window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":19,"en":"Health, Ageing & Public Health","zh":"健康、老化與公共衛生","items":[{"w":"clinic","pos":"n.","def":"a small place where people see a doctor","cn":"診所","s":"My grandmother goes to the ________ near our home every month, and the doctor there checks her blood pressure.","zh":"我奶奶每個月都去我們家附近的診所,那裡的醫生會幫她量血壓。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A1","t":"診所"},{"w":"outpatient","pos":"n.","def":"a patient who visits a hospital but does not stay overnight","cn":"門診病人","s":"The hospital treats more than two thousand ________ every day, so the waiting area is always crowded.","zh":"這間醫院每天治療兩千多名門診病人,所以候診區總是很擁擠。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A2","t":"門診病人"},{"w":"inpatient","pos":"n.","def":"a patient who stays in a hospital for treatment","cn":"住院病人","s":"Visitors can see ________ only between six and eight in the evening, because the patients need plenty of rest.","zh":"訪客只能在晚上六點到八點探視住院病人,因為病人需要充分休息。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A3","t":"住院病人"},{"w":"emergency room","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the part of a hospital for people who need help immediately","cn":"急診室","s":"My brother broke his arm at basketball practice, so we rushed him to the ______ ______ late at night.","zh":"我弟弟在籃球練習時摔斷了手臂,所以我們深夜急忙把他送到急診室。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A4","t":"急診室"},{"w":"ambulance","pos":"n.","def":"a vehicle that takes sick or injured people to hospital","cn":"救護車","s":"An old man fainted on the MRT platform, and a passenger called an ________ while others gave him water.","zh":"一位老先生在捷運月台上昏倒,一名乘客叫了救護車,其他人則給他水喝。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A5","t":"救護車"},{"w":"paramedic","pos":"n.","def":"a trained person who gives medical help in an ambulance","cn":"醫護救援人員","s":"The ________ arrived within ten minutes, and they treated the driver before they took him to hospital.","zh":"醫護救援人員在十分鐘內抵達,他們先為駕駛治療,再把他送往醫院。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A6","t":"醫護救援人員"},{"w":"general practitioner","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a family doctor who treats common illnesses","cn":"家庭醫師;一般科醫師","s":"If you have a cough that lasts for weeks, you should first see a ______ ______, and he may send you to a specialist.","zh":"如果你咳嗽持續好幾週,應該先去看家庭醫師,他可能會把你轉介給專科醫師。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A7","t":"家庭醫師"},{"w":"physician","pos":"n.","def":"a medical doctor","cn":"內科醫師;醫師","s":"The ________ listened carefully to my father's heart, but she said he needed more tests to be sure.","zh":"那位醫師仔細聽了我爸爸的心跳,但她說需要更多檢查才能確定。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A8","t":"醫師"},{"w":"specialist","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who knows a lot about one area of medicine","cn":"專科醫師","s":"My mother waited three weeks to see a skin ________, but the treatment finally cleared her problem.","zh":"我媽媽等了三週才看到皮膚科專科醫師,但治療終於解決了她的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A9","t":"專科醫師"},{"w":"pharmacist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who prepares and sells medicine","cn":"藥劑師","s":"The ________ explained how often I should take the medicine, and she warned me not to drink coffee with it.","zh":"藥劑師向我解釋藥要多久吃一次,還提醒我不要配咖啡服用。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A10","t":"藥劑師"},{"w":"pharmacy","pos":"n.","def":"a shop where medicines are sold","cn":"藥局","s":"There is a 24-hour ________ next to the hospital, so patients can get their medicine even late at night.","zh":"醫院旁邊有一家二十四小時營業的藥局,所以病人即使深夜也能拿到藥。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A11","t":"藥局"},{"w":"prescription","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor's written order for medicine","cn":"處方箋","s":"You cannot buy this strong medicine without a ________, so you need to see a doctor first.","zh":"沒有處方箋你不能買這種強效藥物,所以你需要先去看醫生。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A12","t":"處方箋"},{"w":"check-up","pos":"n.","def":"a general medical examination","cn":"健康檢查","s":"My parents have a full ________ every year, because doctors can find many problems early this way.","zh":"我爸媽每年都做一次完整的健康檢查,因為醫生可以藉此及早發現許多問題。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A13","t":"健康檢查"},{"w":"appointment","pos":"n.","def":"an arranged time to meet a doctor or other person","cn":"預約;掛號","s":"I made an ________ with the dentist online, so I did not have to wait in line at the clinic.","zh":"我在網路上和牙醫預約了時間,所以不必在診所排隊等候。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A14","t":"預約"},{"w":"waiting list","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a list of people who must wait for a service","cn":"候補名單;等候名單","s":"There is a long ______ ______ for knee operations, so some patients wait almost a year for surgery.","zh":"膝蓋手術的等候名單很長,所以有些病人要等將近一年才能開刀。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A15","t":"等候名單"},{"w":"admit","pos":"v.","def":"to let someone stay in hospital for treatment","cn":"使住院;收治","s":"The doctor decided to ________ my grandfather for a few days, because his fever was not going down.","zh":"醫生決定讓我爺爺住院幾天,因為他的燒一直沒有退。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A16","t":"住院"},{"w":"referral","pos":"n.","def":"sending a patient to another doctor or service","cn":"轉介;轉診","s":"My family doctor wrote a ________ to the eye hospital, and I got an appointment there the next week.","zh":"我的家庭醫師開了一張到眼科醫院的轉診單,我隔週就在那裡掛到號了。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A17","t":"轉診單"},{"w":"consultation","pos":"n.","def":"a meeting with a doctor to discuss a health problem","cn":"看診;諮詢","s":"Each ________ lasts only five minutes at the busy clinic, so I write down my questions before I go.","zh":"在那間忙碌的診所,每次看診只有五分鐘,所以我去之前會先把問題寫下來。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A18","t":"看診"},{"w":"intensive care unit","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a hospital area for very seriously ill patients","cn":"加護病房","s":"After the car accident, the driver spent two weeks in the ______ ______ ______, but he is now slowly recovering.","zh":"車禍之後,那名駕駛在加護病房待了兩週,但他現在正慢慢康復。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A19","t":"加護病房"},{"w":"stretcher","pos":"n.","def":"a long frame used to carry a sick or injured person","cn":"擔架","s":"The player could not walk after the fall, so two medics carried him off the field on a ________.","zh":"那名球員跌倒後無法走路,所以兩名醫護人員用擔架把他抬離球場。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A20","t":"擔架"},{"w":"wheelchair","pos":"n.","def":"a chair with wheels for people who cannot walk","cn":"輪椅","s":"My grandmother uses a ________ after her operation, so we chose a restaurant with no steps at the entrance.","zh":"我奶奶手術後要坐輪椅,所以我們選了一家入口沒有階梯的餐廳。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A21","t":"輪椅"},{"w":"blood test","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a check of a small amount of blood for health problems","cn":"驗血","s":"You must not eat breakfast before the ______ ______, because food can change the results.","zh":"驗血前你不能吃早餐,因為食物會影響檢驗結果。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A22","t":"驗血"},{"w":"medical record","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the official history of a person's health and treatment","cn":"病歷","s":"Doctors in Taiwan can check your ______ ______ on your health card, so they know which medicines you are taking.","zh":"台灣的醫生可以透過健保卡查看你的病歷,所以他們知道你正在服用哪些藥。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A23","t":"病歷"},{"w":"health insurance","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a system that pays for medical care","cn":"健康保險","s":"Most people in Taiwan have national ______ ______, so a visit to the doctor costs only a few hundred dollars.","zh":"台灣大多數人都有全民健康保險,所以看一次醫生只要幾百元。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A24","t":"健康保險"},{"w":"triage","pos":"n.","def":"deciding which patients need treatment first","cn":"檢傷分類","s":"In the emergency room, nurses use ________ to decide who needs help first, so people with small injuries may wait longer.","zh":"在急診室裡,護理師會用檢傷分類決定誰最需要先治療,所以小傷的人可能要等比較久。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A25","t":"檢傷分類"},{"w":"paediatrician","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who treats children","cn":"小兒科醫師","s":"The baby had a high temperature all night, so her parents took her to the ________ early in the morning.","zh":"寶寶整晚發高燒,所以她的爸媽一大早就帶她去看小兒科醫師。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A26","t":"小兒科醫師"},{"w":"cardiologist","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who treats heart problems","cn":"心臟科醫師","s":"My uncle often felt pain in his chest, so his doctor sent him to a ________ for more tests.","zh":"我叔叔常常胸口痛,所以他的醫生把他轉給心臟科醫師做更多檢查。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A27","t":"心臟科醫師"},{"w":"operating theatre","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a room in a hospital where operations are done","cn":"手術室","s":"The surgeons were already waiting in the ______ ______, and the nurses prepared all the tools for the long operation.","zh":"外科醫師已經在手術室裡等候,護理師們則為這場漫長的手術準備好所有器械。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A28","t":"手術室"},{"w":"hospital bed","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a bed in a hospital for a patient","cn":"病床","s":"During the flu season there were not enough ______ ______, so some patients had to stay in the corridor.","zh":"流感季期間病床不夠,所以有些病人只能待在走廊上。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A29","t":"病床"},{"w":"out-of-pocket","pos":"adj.","def":"paid by the patient, not by insurance","cn":"自費的;自付的","s":"The new cancer drug is not covered by insurance, so the ________ costs are too high for many families.","zh":"這種新的抗癌藥不在保險給付範圍內,所以自費金額對許多家庭來說太高了。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A30","t":"自費"},{"w":"medical staff","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the doctors and nurses who work in a hospital","cn":"醫護人員","s":"The ______ ______ worked very long hours during the pandemic, and many of them were completely exhausted.","zh":"疫情期間醫護人員工作時數非常長,他們當中許多人都筋疲力盡。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A31","t":"醫護人員"},{"w":"night shift","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a period of work during the night","cn":"夜班","s":"My aunt is a nurse who often works the ______ ______, so she sleeps during the day while we are at school.","zh":"我阿姨是護理師,經常上夜班,所以我們上學時她在白天睡覺。","part":"A","sec":"Medical Care & Hospitals 醫療照護與醫院","lab":"A32","t":"夜班"},{"w":"disease","pos":"n.","def":"an illness of people, animals or plants","cn":"疾病","s":"Heart ________ is one of the main causes of death in Taiwan, but a healthy diet can lower the risk.","zh":"心臟疾病是台灣主要的死因之一,但健康的飲食可以降低風險。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A33","t":"疾病"},{"w":"illness","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being sick","cn":"生病;疾病","s":"Tom missed two weeks of school because of a serious ________, so his classmates sent him their notes.","zh":"湯姆因為一場嚴重的疾病缺課兩週,所以同學們把筆記寄給他。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A34","t":"疾病"},{"w":"infection","pos":"n.","def":"a disease caused by germs entering the body","cn":"感染","s":"The cut on my knee became red and hot, so the doctor said I had an ________ and gave me some cream.","zh":"我膝蓋上的傷口變得又紅又熱,所以醫生說我被感染了,並給了我一些藥膏。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A35","t":"感染"},{"w":"infect","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone a disease","cn":"傳染;使感染","s":"Please stay at home when you have the flu, because you could easily ________ your classmates.","zh":"得流感時請待在家裡,因為你很容易傳染給同學。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A36","t":"傳染"},{"w":"germ","pos":"n.","def":"a very small living thing that can cause disease","cn":"細菌;病菌","s":"Wash your hands before you eat, because your fingers carry many ________ that you cannot see.","zh":"吃東西前要洗手,因為你的手指上帶有許多看不見的病菌。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A37","t":"病菌"},{"w":"pandemic","pos":"n.","def":"a disease that spreads over many countries","cn":"全球大流行病","s":"The COVID-19 ________ closed schools around the world, so millions of students had to study online.","zh":"新冠肺炎全球大流行讓世界各地的學校停課,所以數百萬學生必須在線上學習。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A38","t":"全球大流行"},{"w":"airborne","pos":"adj.","def":"carried through the air","cn":"經由空氣傳播的","s":"Measles is an ________ disease, so it can spread quickly in a crowded classroom with closed windows.","zh":"麻疹是一種經由空氣傳播的疾病,所以在門窗緊閉、擁擠的教室裡會快速傳播。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A39","t":"經由空氣傳播的"},{"w":"droplet","pos":"n.","def":"a very small drop of liquid","cn":"飛沫","s":"When you sneeze, tiny ________ fly into the air, so you should cover your mouth with your elbow.","zh":"打噴嚏時微小的飛沫會飛到空中,所以你應該用手肘遮住嘴巴。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A40","t":"飛沫"},{"w":"incubation period","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the time between catching a disease and showing signs","cn":"潛伏期","s":"The virus has an ______ ______ of about five days, so people can spread it before they feel sick.","zh":"這種病毒的潛伏期大約五天,所以人們在感到不舒服之前就可能傳播病毒。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A41","t":"潛伏期"},{"w":"asymptomatic","pos":"adj.","def":"having a disease but showing no signs of it","cn":"無症狀的","s":"Many young people were ________, so they did not know they had the virus until they took a test.","zh":"許多年輕人是無症狀的,所以他們直到做了檢測才知道自己感染了病毒。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A42","t":"無症狀的"},{"w":"fever","pos":"n.","def":"a body temperature that is higher than normal","cn":"發燒","s":"My little sister had a high ________ last night, so my mother stayed with her and checked her temperature every hour.","zh":"我妹妹昨晚發高燒,所以媽媽陪著她,每小時量一次體溫。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A43","t":"發 燒"},{"w":"cough","pos":"n.","def":"the act or sound of pushing air out of the throat","cn":"咳嗽","s":"I have had a dry ________ for two weeks, so the doctor wants me to take an X-ray of my chest.","zh":"我已經乾咳兩週了,所以醫生要我照一張胸部X光片。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A44","t":"咳"},{"w":"sneeze","pos":"v.","def":"to force air out through the nose suddenly","cn":"打噴嚏","s":"Every spring I ________ a lot because of the pollen, so I always carry tissues in my bag.","zh":"每年春天我都因為花粉常常打噴嚏,所以我總是在包包裡放面紙。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A45","t":"打噴嚏"},{"w":"sore throat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"pain in the throat, often from a cold","cn":"喉嚨痛","s":"I had a ______ ______ after the concert, so I drank warm water with honey and stopped talking for a day.","zh":"演唱會後我喉嚨痛,所以我喝了溫蜂蜜水,還一整天不說話。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A46","t":"喉嚨痛"},{"w":"runny nose","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a nose with liquid coming out because of a cold","cn":"流鼻水","s":"The little boy had a ______ ______ all week, but he still wanted to play outside with his friends.","zh":"那個小男孩整個星期都在流鼻水,但他還是想和朋友在外面玩。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A47","t":"流鼻水"},{"w":"influenza","pos":"n.","def":"a common infectious illness with fever and aches; the flu","cn":"流行性感冒","s":"Every winter many elderly people catch ________, so the government offers them free flu jabs.","zh":"每年冬天許多長者會感染流行性感冒,所以政府提供他們免費的流感疫苗。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A48","t":"流行性感冒"},{"w":"common cold","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a mild illness with a runny nose and sore throat","cn":"普通感冒","s":"There is still no cure for the ______ ______, but most people feel better after about a week.","zh":"普通感冒至今仍無法根治,但大多數人大約一週後就會好轉。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A49","t":"普通感冒"},{"w":"tuberculosis","pos":"n.","def":"a serious infectious disease that mainly affects the lungs","cn":"肺結核","s":"________ can be cured with medicine, but patients must take the pills every day for several months.","zh":"肺結核可以用藥物治癒,但病人必須連續數個月每天服藥。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A50","t":"肺結核"},{"w":"measles","pos":"n.","def":"an infectious disease that causes red spots and fever","cn":"麻疹","s":"________ spreads very easily among children, so doctors want every child to be vaccinated before school.","zh":"麻疹在兒童之間非常容易傳播,所以醫生希望每個孩子上學前都接種疫苗。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A51","t":"麻疹"},{"w":"dengue fever","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tropical disease spread by mosquitoes","cn":"登革熱","s":"Cases of ______ ______ rise in southern Taiwan every summer, so residents are told to empty water from old containers.","zh":"每年夏天南台灣的登革熱病例都會增加,所以居民被要求清除舊容器裡的積水。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A52","t":"登革熱"},{"w":"hepatitis","pos":"n.","def":"a disease that damages the liver","cn":"肝炎","s":"________ B used to be very common in Taiwan, but a vaccine for babies has reduced it greatly.","zh":"B型肝炎過去在台灣非常普遍,但嬰兒疫苗已經大幅減少了這種病。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A53","t":"肝炎"},{"w":"cancer","pos":"n.","def":"a serious disease in which cells grow in an uncontrolled way","cn":"癌症","s":"Smoking is a major cause of lung ________, so my father finally quit after his doctor warned him.","zh":"吸菸是肺癌的主要成因,所以我爸爸在醫生警告後終於戒菸了。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A54","t":"癌"},{"w":"tumour","pos":"n.","def":"a lump that grows inside the body","cn":"腫瘤","s":"The scan showed a small ________ in her brain, but luckily the doctors could remove it completely.","zh":"掃描顯示她的腦部有一個小腫瘤,但幸運的是醫生能將它完全切除。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A55","t":"腫瘤"},{"w":"heart disease","pos":"n.phr.","def":"any illness that affects the heart","cn":"心臟病","s":"Eating too much salt can lead to ______ ______, so the school canteen now uses less salt in its dishes.","zh":"吃太多鹽可能導致心臟病,所以學校餐廳現在的菜都少放鹽了。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A56","t":"心臟病"},{"w":"heart attack","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sudden serious problem when blood stops reaching the heart","cn":"心臟病發作","s":"A man had a ______ ______ in the gym, but a staff member saved his life with CPR before the ambulance came.","zh":"一名男子在健身房心臟病發作,但一位員工在救護車抵達前用心肺復甦術救了他一命。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A57","t":"心臟病發作"},{"w":"respiratory","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to breathing and the lungs","cn":"呼吸的;呼吸系統的","s":"Air pollution can cause ________ problems, so many people wear masks on days when the air quality is poor.","zh":"空氣污染會引起呼吸系統的問題,所以空氣品質差的日子許多人會戴口罩。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A58","t":"呼吸系統的"},{"w":"pneumonia","pos":"n.","def":"a serious infection of the lungs","cn":"肺炎","s":"My grandfather caught a cold that turned into ________, so he had to stay in hospital for ten days.","zh":"我爺爺的感冒惡化成肺炎,所以他必須住院十天。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A59","t":"肺炎"},{"w":"chickenpox","pos":"n.","def":"a common children's disease that causes itchy red spots","cn":"水痘","s":"My little brother caught ________ at kindergarten, and he had itchy red spots all over his body for a week.","zh":"我弟弟在幼兒園得了水痘,他全身長滿會癢的紅疹,持續了一週。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A60","t":"水痘"},{"w":"allergy","pos":"n.","def":"a bad reaction of the body to certain food, dust or plants","cn":"過敏","s":"Jenny has a peanut ________, so she always checks the label before she buys any snacks.","zh":"珍妮對花生過敏,所以她買任何零食前都會先看標籤。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A61","t":"過敏"},{"w":"asthma","pos":"n.","def":"an illness that makes breathing difficult at times","cn":"氣喘","s":"Kevin has ________, so he always carries an inhaler when he goes running in cold weather.","zh":"凱文有氣喘,所以天冷去跑步時他總是隨身帶著吸入器。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A62","t":"氣喘"},{"w":"self-isolate","pos":"v.","def":"to stay away from other people to avoid spreading a disease","cn":"自我隔離","s":"After she tested positive, she had to ________ at home for five days, so her friends delivered food to her door.","zh":"她檢測呈陽性後必須在家自我隔離五天,所以朋友們把食物送到她家門口。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A63","t":"自我隔離"},{"w":"super-spreader","pos":"n.","def":"a person who passes a disease to many others","cn":"超級傳播者","s":"One ________ at the wedding infected forty guests, and health officials had to trace all of them.","zh":"婚禮上一名超級傳播者傳染了四十位賓客,衛生官員必須追蹤所有人。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A64","t":"超級傳播者"},{"w":"immunity","pos":"n.","def":"the body's ability to fight a disease","cn":"免疫力","s":"After you have had chickenpox, you usually have ________ for life, so you will not catch it again.","zh":"得過水痘之後,你通常會有終身免疫力,所以不會再被感染。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A65","t":"免疫力"},{"w":"antibody","pos":"n.","def":"a substance the body makes to fight germs","cn":"抗體","s":"The vaccine helps your body make ________, and these protect you if the real virus enters your body.","zh":"疫苗幫助你的身體製造抗體,而當真正的病毒進入體內時,這些抗體會保護你。","part":"A","sec":"Diseases & Infection 疾病與感染","lab":"A66","t":"抗體"},{"w":"vaccination","pos":"n.","def":"giving people a vaccine to protect them from disease","cn":"預防接種","s":"________ has saved millions of lives, but some parents still worry about the side effects.","zh":"預防接種已經拯救了數百萬條生命,但有些家長仍擔心副作用。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A67","t":"預防接種"},{"w":"vaccinate","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone a vaccine","cn":"為……接種疫苗","s":"The school nurse will ________ all first-year students next week, so parents must sign the form by Friday.","zh":"學校護理師下週將為所有一年級學生接種疫苗,所以家長必須在週五前簽好同意書。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A68","t":"接種疫苗"},{"w":"booster","pos":"n.","def":"an extra dose of a vaccine to keep protection strong","cn":"追加劑","s":"Protection from the vaccine becomes weaker over time, so older people are advised to get a ________ every year.","zh":"疫苗的保護力會隨著時間減弱,所以建議長者每年接種一劑追加劑。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A69","t":"追加劑"},{"w":"jab","pos":"n.","def":"an injection, especially a vaccine (informal)","cn":"打針;疫苗注射","s":"I was nervous about my flu ________, but it was quick and my arm only hurt a little the next day.","zh":"我對打流感疫苗很緊張,但它很快就結束了,隔天手臂只痛了一點點。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A70","t":"疫苗"},{"w":"dose","pos":"n.","def":"an amount of medicine taken at one time","cn":"一劑;劑量","s":"Take one ________ of this medicine after each meal, but do not take more than three in one day.","zh":"這種藥每餐飯後吃一劑,但一天不要超過三次。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A71","t":"劑"},{"w":"pill","pos":"n.","def":"a small round piece of medicine that you swallow","cn":"藥丸","s":"My grandfather takes four different ________ every morning, so he uses a box with the days of the week on it.","zh":"我爺爺每天早上要吃四種不同的藥丸,所以他用一個標有星期幾的藥盒。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A72","t":"藥丸"},{"w":"capsule","pos":"n.","def":"a small tube of medicine that you swallow whole","cn":"膠囊","s":"Swallow the ________ with a full glass of water, and do not open it or chew it.","zh":"請配一整杯水吞下這顆膠囊,不要打開或咀嚼它。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A73","t":"膠囊"},{"w":"antiviral","pos":"adj.","def":"used to fight viruses","cn":"抗病毒的","s":"The doctor gave her ________ medicine on the first day of the flu, so she recovered much faster.","zh":"醫生在她得流感的第一天就開了抗病毒藥物,所以她康復得快多了。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A74","t":"抗病毒"},{"w":"ointment","pos":"n.","def":"a smooth cream you put on the skin to heal it","cn":"藥膏","s":"Put this ________ on the burn twice a day, and keep the area clean and dry.","zh":"這種藥膏每天擦在燙傷處兩次,並保持患部清潔乾燥。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A75","t":"藥膏"},{"w":"syringe","pos":"n.","def":"a tube with a needle used to give injections","cn":"注射器;針筒","s":"The nurse filled the ________ with the vaccine, and then she asked me to relax my arm.","zh":"護理師把疫苗吸進注射器,然後請我放鬆手臂。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A76","t":"注射器"},{"w":"injection","pos":"n.","def":"putting medicine into the body with a needle","cn":"注射;打針","s":"Some children cry when they get an ________, so the nurse gives them a sticker afterwards.","zh":"有些孩子打針時會哭,所以護理師之後會送他們一張貼紙。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A77","t":"打針"},{"w":"inject","pos":"v.","def":"to put medicine into the body with a needle","cn":"注射","s":"People with diabetes may need to ________ insulin every day, so they learn to do it themselves.","zh":"糖尿病患者可能每天都需要注射胰島素,所以他們學會自己打針。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A78","t":"注射"},{"w":"antiseptic","pos":"n.","def":"a liquid or cream that kills germs on cuts","cn":"消毒劑;抗菌劑","s":"Clean the cut with some ________ first, or it may become infected in this hot weather.","zh":"先用一點消毒劑清潔傷口,否則在這麼熱的天氣裡可能會感染。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A79","t":"消毒劑"},{"w":"heal","pos":"v.","def":"to become healthy again after an injury","cn":"癒合;痊癒","s":"The cut on his hand took two weeks to ________, because he kept getting it wet at work.","zh":"他手上的傷口花了兩週才癒合,因為他工作時一直把它弄濕。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A80","t":"癒合"},{"w":"chemotherapy","pos":"n.","def":"treatment of cancer with strong drugs","cn":"化學治療;化療","s":"My aunt lost her hair during ________, but it grew back after her treatment finished.","zh":"我阿姨在化療期間掉了頭髮,但治療結束後頭髮又長回來了。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A81","t":"化療"},{"w":"radiotherapy","pos":"n.","def":"treatment of cancer using radiation","cn":"放射治療;放療","s":"After the operation, he needed six weeks of ________, so he went to the hospital every weekday.","zh":"手術後他需要六週的放射治療,所以他每個平日都要去醫院。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A82","t":"放射治療"},{"w":"organ donation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"giving a body part to help someone who is ill","cn":"器官捐贈","s":"My father signed up for ______ ______, because he believes it is a way to save lives after death.","zh":"我爸爸簽署了器官捐贈同意書,因為他相信這是死後拯救生命的一種方式。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A83","t":"器官捐贈"},{"w":"operation","pos":"n.","def":"cutting the body open to repair or remove something","cn":"手術","s":"The ________ on her knee was successful, but she must use crutches for a month.","zh":"她的膝蓋手術很成功,但她必須拄一個月的拐杖。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A84","t":"手術"},{"w":"relieve","pos":"v.","def":"to make pain or a problem less bad","cn":"減輕;緩解","s":"A hot shower can ________ the pain in your back, and gentle stretching will also help.","zh":"洗個熱水澡可以緩解背痛,溫和的伸展也會有幫助。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A85","t":"緩解"},{"w":"overdose","pos":"n.","def":"too much of a drug taken at one time","cn":"用藥過量","s":"Never take two kinds of cold medicine together, because an ________ of paracetamol can damage your liver.","zh":"絕不要同時服用兩種感冒藥,因為乙醯胺酚用藥過量會傷害你的肝臟。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A86","t":"用藥過量"},{"w":"herbal medicine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"medicine made from plants","cn":"草藥","s":"Many older people in Taiwan use ______ ______, but they should tell their doctor because it can mix badly with other drugs.","zh":"台灣許多長者會使用草藥,但他們應該告訴醫生,因為它可能和其他藥物產生不良交互作用。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A87","t":"草藥"},{"w":"acupuncture","pos":"n.","def":"treatment using thin needles put into the skin","cn":"針灸","s":"My mother tried ________ for her shoulder pain, and she said she felt better after three visits.","zh":"我媽媽為了肩膀痛去試了針灸,她說去了三次後感覺好多了。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A88","t":"針灸"},{"w":"over-the-counter","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be bought without a doctor's prescription","cn":"非處方的;成藥的","s":"You can buy ________ medicine for a headache at any pharmacy, but read the instructions carefully.","zh":"你可以在任何藥局買到治頭痛的成藥,但要仔細閱讀說明。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A89","t":"成藥"},{"w":"generic drug","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a cheaper copy of a brand-name medicine","cn":"學名藥","s":"The hospital now uses a ______ ______ for high blood pressure, because it works the same but costs much less.","zh":"醫院現在改用一種治療高血壓的學名藥,因為效果相同但便宜得多。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A90","t":"學名藥"},{"w":"herd immunity","pos":"n.phr.","def":"protection that happens when most people in a group are immune","cn":"群體免疫","s":"When most children are vaccinated, ______ ______ protects babies who are too young for the vaccine.","zh":"當大多數孩子都接種疫苗時,群體免疫就能保護年紀太小還不能打疫苗的嬰兒。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A91","t":"群體免疫"},{"w":"vaccine hesitancy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"unwillingness or delay in getting vaccinated","cn":"疫苗猶豫","s":"______ ______ grew because of false stories online, so doctors started making short videos to explain the facts.","zh":"疫苗猶豫因網路上的不實消息而增加,所以醫生們開始製作短片來說明事實。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A92","t":"疫苗猶豫"},{"w":"needle","pos":"n.","def":"a thin sharp metal tube used for injections","cn":"針;針頭","s":"Some adults are afraid of ________, so they look away while the nurse gives them a vaccine.","zh":"有些大人害怕針頭,所以護理師幫他們打疫苗時他們會把頭轉開。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A93","t":"針頭"},{"w":"stitches","pos":"n.","def":"short threads used to close a cut in the skin","cn":"縫針;縫線","s":"He cut his head when he fell off his bike, so the doctor gave him five ________ in the emergency room.","zh":"他騎腳踏車摔倒時割傷了頭,所以醫生在急診室幫他縫了五針。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A94","t":"針"},{"w":"scar","pos":"n.","def":"a mark left on the skin after a wound heals","cn":"疤痕","s":"The operation left a long ________ on his stomach, but he says it reminds him how lucky he is.","zh":"手術在他的肚子上留下一道長長的疤痕,但他說這提醒他自己有多幸運。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A95","t":"疤痕"},{"w":"wound","pos":"n.","def":"an injury where the skin is cut or broken","cn":"傷口","s":"The nurse cleaned the ________ carefully and covered it, and she told me to change the bandage every day.","zh":"護理師仔細清理了傷口並包紮起來,她告訴我每天換一次繃帶。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A96","t":"傷口"},{"w":"cough syrup","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sweet liquid medicine for coughs","cn":"止咳糖漿","s":"This ______ ______ may make you sleepy, so you should not drive after you take it.","zh":"這種止咳糖漿可能會讓你想睡,所以服用後不應該開車。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A97","t":"止咳糖漿"},{"w":"eye drops","pos":"n.phr.","def":"liquid medicine that you put into your eyes","cn":"眼藥水","s":"My eyes feel dry after hours on the computer, so the doctor told me to use ______ ______ three times a day.","zh":"我在電腦前待好幾個小時後眼睛很乾,所以醫生要我一天點三次眼藥水。","part":"A","sec":"Vaccines, Medicine & Treatment 疫苗、藥物與治療","lab":"A98","t":"眼藥水"},{"w":"ageing population","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a population with a growing share of old people","cn":"人口老化","s":"Taiwan has a rapidly ______ ______, so the government needs more care workers and nursing homes.","zh":"台灣正面臨快速的人口老化,所以政府需要更多照顧服務員和護理之家。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A99","t":"人口老化"},{"w":"super-aged society","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a society where over 20% of people are 65 or older","cn":"超高齡社會","s":"Taiwan became a ______ ______ in 2025, which means more than one in five people are over sixty-five.","zh":"台灣在2025年成為超高齡社會,這表示每五個人當中就有超過一人年滿六十五歲。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A100","t":"超高齡社會"},{"w":"senior citizen","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an older person, usually over 65","cn":"年長者;老年人","s":"______ ______ can ride the bus at a discount in Taipei, so my grandparents often travel around the city.","zh":"台北的年長者搭公車可享優惠,所以我的祖父母常常在城市裡四處走走。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A101","t":"年長者"},{"w":"pensioner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who receives a pension after retiring","cn":"領退休金的人","s":"Many ________ in Taiwan worry about rising prices, because their monthly income does not increase much.","zh":"台灣許多領退休金的人擔心物價上漲,因為他們每月的收入並沒有增加多少。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A102","t":"領退休金的人"},{"w":"retiree","pos":"n.","def":"a person who has stopped working because of age","cn":"退休人士","s":"Many ________ volunteer at the local library, and they enjoy reading stories to young children.","zh":"許多退休人士在當地圖書館當志工,他們喜歡為小朋友讀故事。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A103","t":"退休人士"},{"w":"centenarian","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is 100 years old or more","cn":"百歲人瑞","s":"The number of ________ in Taiwan has grown quickly, so scientists are studying their daily habits.","zh":"台灣百歲人瑞的人數快速增加,所以科學家正在研究他們的日常習慣。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A104","t":"百歲人瑞"},{"w":"old age","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the later part of life","cn":"老年;晚年","s":"My grandfather is still very active in his ______ ______, and he goes swimming three times a week.","zh":"我爺爺在晚年仍然非常活躍,他每週去游泳三次。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A105","t":"晚年"},{"w":"wrinkle","pos":"n.","def":"a line that forms on the skin as you get older","cn":"皺紋","s":"My grandmother laughs a lot, so she has many ________ around her eyes, but she says each one is a happy memory.","zh":"我奶奶很愛笑,所以眼睛周圍有很多皺紋,但她說每一條都是快樂的回憶。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A106","t":"皺紋"},{"w":"grey hair","pos":"n.phr.","def":"hair that has lost its colour with age","cn":"白髮","s":"My father found his first ______ ______ at forty, and he joked that his teenage children were the reason.","zh":"我爸爸四十歲時發現了第一根白髮,他開玩笑說原因是家裡那幾個青少年孩子。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A107","t":"白髮"},{"w":"hearing aid","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small device that helps people hear better","cn":"助聽器","s":"My grandfather wears a ______ ______ now, so he can join our conversations at dinner again.","zh":"我爺爺現在戴著助聽器,所以他又能在晚餐時加入我們的談話了。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A108","t":"助聽器"},{"w":"walking stick","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a stick that helps a person walk","cn":"手杖;拐杖","s":"My grandmother uses a ______ ______ on the hiking trail, because the path is steep and sometimes slippery.","zh":"我奶奶在登山步道上會用手杖,因為那條路很陡,有時又很滑。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A109","t":"手杖"},{"w":"reading glasses","pos":"n.phr.","def":"glasses that help older people see small print","cn":"老花眼鏡","s":"My mother needs ______ ______ to read the menu, but she keeps forgetting them at home.","zh":"我媽媽需要老花眼鏡才能看菜單,但她老是把眼鏡忘在家裡。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A110","t":"老花眼鏡"},{"w":"cataract","pos":"n.","def":"a cloudy area in the eye that makes it hard to see","cn":"白內障","s":"My grandfather had ________ surgery last year, and now he can see colours clearly again.","zh":"我爺爺去年做了白內障手術,現在他又能清楚看見顏色了。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A111","t":"白內障"},{"w":"osteoporosis","pos":"n.","def":"a disease that makes bones weak and easy to break","cn":"骨質疏鬆症","s":"Women over fifty have a higher risk of ________, so doctors advise them to get enough calcium and exercise.","zh":"五十歲以上的女性罹患骨質疏鬆症的風險較高,所以醫生建議她們攝取足夠的鈣並運動。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A112","t":"骨質疏鬆症"},{"w":"arthritis","pos":"n.","def":"a disease that makes joints painful and stiff","cn":"關節炎","s":"My grandmother has ________ in her fingers, so she finds it hard to open jars and button her clothes.","zh":"我奶奶的手指有關節炎,所以她很難打開罐子和扣衣服的扣子。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A113","t":"關節炎"},{"w":"hip fracture","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a break in the bone at the top of the leg","cn":"髖部骨折","s":"Falls at home often cause a ______ ______ in older people, so families should remove loose rugs and add handrails.","zh":"在家跌倒常導致長者髖部骨折,所以家人應該移除鬆動的地毯並加裝扶手。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A114","t":"髖部骨折"},{"w":"frailty","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being physically weak, often due to age","cn":"衰弱","s":"Regular exercise can slow down ________ in old age, so the community centre offers free classes for seniors.","zh":"規律運動可以減緩老年的衰弱,所以社區中心為長者開設免費課程。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A115","t":"衰弱"},{"w":"bedridden","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to get out of bed because of illness or age","cn":"臥床不起的","s":"After the stroke, my great-aunt was ________ for months, so a care worker came to help her every day.","zh":"中風後,我姑婆臥床好幾個月,所以每天都有照顧服務員來幫忙她。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A116","t":"臥床"},{"w":"memory loss","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the inability to remember things","cn":"失憶;記憶力減退","s":"Some ______ ______ is normal with age, but if it affects daily life, you should see a doctor.","zh":"隨著年齡增長出現一些記憶力減退是正常的,但如果影響到日常生活,你就應該去看醫生。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A117","t":"記憶力減退"},{"w":"care worker","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person whose job is to look after old or sick people","cn":"照顧服務員","s":"A ______ ______ visits my grandmother three times a week, and she helps her with bathing and cooking.","zh":"一位照顧服務員每週來探視我奶奶三次,幫她洗澡和做飯。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A118","t":"照顧服務員"},{"w":"home care","pos":"n.phr.","def":"care given to people in their own homes","cn":"居家照護","s":"Most older people prefer ______ ______ to nursing homes, because they want to stay in a familiar place.","zh":"比起護理之家,大多數長者更喜歡居家照護,因為他們想待在熟悉的地方。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A119","t":"居家照護"},{"w":"day care centre","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place that looks after older people during the day","cn":"日間照顧中心","s":"My grandfather goes to a ______ ______ ______ while my parents are at work, and he enjoys the singing classes there.","zh":"我爸媽上班時,爺爺會去日間照顧中心,他很喜歡那裡的歌唱課。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A120","t":"日間照顧中心"},{"w":"long-term care","pos":"n.phr.","def":"support for people who cannot fully look after themselves for a long time","cn":"長期照顧;長照","s":"The government expanded its ______ ______ plan, so more families can get help with elderly relatives.","zh":"政府擴大了長期照顧計畫,所以更多家庭能在照顧年長親人方面得到協助。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A121","t":"長期照顧"},{"w":"nursing home","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where old or ill people live and receive care","cn":"護理之家;養護機構","s":"We visit my great-grandmother at the ______ ______ every Sunday, and we often bring her favourite cakes.","zh":"我們每週日去護理之家探望曾祖母,常常帶她最喜歡的蛋糕過去。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A122","t":"護理之家"},{"w":"retirement home","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where retired people live together","cn":"養老院;退休住宅","s":"My grandparents moved into a ______ ______ by the sea, and they have made many new friends there.","zh":"我的祖父母搬進了海邊的一間養老院,他們在那裡交了許多新朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A123","t":"養老院"},{"w":"assisted living","pos":"n.phr.","def":"housing where older people get some help with daily tasks","cn":"協助型生活住宅","s":"______ ______ lets older people keep their own apartment, but staff are there to help when they need it.","zh":"協助型生活住宅讓長者保有自己的公寓,而當他們需要時,工作人員就在身邊提供協助。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A124","t":"協助型生活住宅"},{"w":"filial piety","pos":"n.phr.","def":"respect and care for one's parents and older relatives","cn":"孝道","s":"______ ______ is an important value in Taiwan, so many adults feel they should take care of their parents at home.","zh":"孝道在台灣是很重要的價值觀,所以許多成年人覺得應該在家照顧父母。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A125","t":"孝道"},{"w":"intergenerational","pos":"adj.","def":"involving people of different generations","cn":"跨世代的","s":"The school started an ________ project, and students now teach seniors how to use smartphones.","zh":"學校展開了一項跨世代計畫,學生現在教長者如何使用智慧型手機。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A126","t":"跨世代"},{"w":"empty nester","pos":"n.","def":"a parent whose children have grown up and left home","cn":"空巢父母","s":"After my sister went to university, my parents became ______ ______, so they started travelling more.","zh":"我姊姊上大學後,我爸媽成了空巢父母,所以他們開始更常去旅行。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A127","t":"空巢父母"},{"w":"widow","pos":"n.","def":"a woman whose husband has died","cn":"寡婦","s":"Our neighbour became a ________ last year, so we often invite her for dinner so she does not feel alone.","zh":"我們的鄰居去年成了寡婦,所以我們常邀她來吃晚餐,讓她不會感到孤單。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A128","t":"寡婦"},{"w":"retirement age","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the age at which people usually stop working","cn":"退休年齡","s":"Some countries have raised the ______ ______ to sixty-seven, because people are living and working longer.","zh":"有些國家已把退休年齡提高到六十七歲,因為人們活得更久、工作也更久。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A129","t":"退休年齡"},{"w":"dependency ratio","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of non-working people compared with workers","cn":"扶養比","s":"As the ______ ______ rises, each worker must support more elderly people through taxes, so young people worry about the future.","zh":"隨著扶養比上升,每位勞工必須透過稅收撫養更多長者,所以年輕人擔心未來。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A130","t":"扶養比"},{"w":"silver economy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"business and services aimed at older people","cn":"銀髮經濟","s":"The ______ ______ is growing fast, so many companies now design products for older customers.","zh":"銀髮經濟正快速成長,所以許多公司現在為年長顧客設計產品。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A131","t":"銀髮經濟"},{"w":"age-friendly","pos":"adj.","def":"designed to be easy for older people to use","cn":"高齡友善的","s":"Our city wants to become more ________, so it is adding benches and lifts to MRT stations.","zh":"我們的城市想變得更加高齡友善,所以正在捷運站增設長椅和電梯。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A132","t":"高齡友善"},{"w":"palliative care","pos":"n.phr.","def":"care that reduces pain for people who cannot be cured","cn":"安寧緩和照護","s":"When the cancer could not be cured, my uncle received ______ ______, so he could spend his last weeks without pain.","zh":"當癌症無法治癒時,我叔叔接受了安寧緩和照護,讓他能沒有痛苦地度過最後幾週。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A133","t":"安寧緩和照護"},{"w":"hospice","pos":"n.","def":"a place that cares for people who are dying","cn":"安寧病房;安寧療護機構","s":"The nurses at the ________ were very kind, and they helped our family say goodbye peacefully.","zh":"安寧病房的護理師非常親切,她們幫助我們全家平靜地道別。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A134","t":"安寧病房"},{"w":"end-of-life care","pos":"n.phr.","def":"medical and emotional care for people near death","cn":"臨終照護","s":"Good ______ ______ respects the wishes of the patient, so families should talk about it early.","zh":"良好的臨終照護會尊重病人的意願,所以家人應該及早討論。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A135","t":"臨終照護"},{"w":"anti-ageing","pos":"adj.","def":"intended to stop or slow the signs of getting older","cn":"抗老的","s":"Many ________ creams are very expensive, but doctors say that cheap sunscreen actually protects your skin much better.","zh":"許多抗老乳霜非常昂貴,但醫生說便宜的防曬乳其實更能保護你的皮膚。","part":"A","sec":"Ageing & Elderly Care 老化與長者照護","lab":"A136","t":"抗老"},{"w":"public health","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the health of the whole population and how it is protected","cn":"公共衛生","s":"Clean water and vaccines are two of the greatest successes in ______ ______, and they have saved millions of lives.","zh":"乾淨的水和疫苗是公共衛生最偉大的兩項成就,它們拯救了數百萬條生命。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A137","t":"公共衛生"},{"w":"epidemiology","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how diseases spread in populations","cn":"流行病學","s":"My cousin studies ________ at university, because she wants to help stop the next pandemic.","zh":"我表姊在大學主修流行病學,因為她想幫忙阻止下一場大流行。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A138","t":"流行病學"},{"w":"epidemiologist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies how diseases spread","cn":"流行病學家","s":"The ________ explained on TV how the virus was spreading, and she asked people to stay calm.","zh":"那位流行病學家在電視上解釋病毒如何傳播,並呼籲民眾保持冷靜。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A139","t":"流行病學家"},{"w":"contact tracing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"finding people who have been near an infected person","cn":"疫調;接觸者追蹤","s":"Taiwan used fast ______ ______ during the pandemic, so health workers could find people at risk quickly.","zh":"台灣在疫情期間採用快速的接觸者追蹤,所以衛生人員能迅速找到高風險的人。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A140","t":"接觸者追蹤"},{"w":"face mask","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a covering for the nose and mouth","cn":"口罩","s":"Many people in Taipei wear a ______ ______ when they have a cold, because they do not want to infect others.","zh":"台北許多人感冒時會戴口罩,因為他們不想傳染給別人。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A141","t":"口罩"},{"w":"hand sanitiser","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a liquid that kills germs on your hands without water","cn":"乾洗手液","s":"There is a bottle of ______ ______ at the door of every classroom, so students clean their hands before they enter.","zh":"每間教室門口都有一瓶乾洗手液,所以學生進教室前會先清潔雙手。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A142","t":"乾洗手液"},{"w":"social distancing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"keeping a safe distance from other people to stop disease","cn":"社交距離","s":"During the outbreak, cinemas left empty seats between customers to allow ______ ______, and many people watched films at home instead.","zh":"疫情爆發期間,電影院在觀眾之間留下空位,以保持社交距離,許多人則改在家看電影。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A143","t":"社交距離"},{"w":"lockdown","pos":"n.","def":"an official order for people to stay at home","cn":"封城","s":"During the ________ the streets of the city were almost empty, and people could only go out to buy food.","zh":"封城期間城市街道幾乎空無一人,人們只能出門買食物。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A144","t":"封城"},{"w":"border control","pos":"n.phr.","def":"checks on people entering a country","cn":"邊境管制","s":"Taiwan introduced strict ______ ______ early in 2020, so the virus spread slowly at first.","zh":"台灣在2020年初實施了嚴格的邊境管制,所以病毒一開始傳播得很慢。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A145","t":"邊境管制"},{"w":"health authority","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a government body in charge of health","cn":"衛生主管機關","s":"The local ______ ______ closed the restaurant for a week, because many customers had food poisoning.","zh":"當地衛生主管機關勒令那家餐廳停業一週,因為許多顧客食物中毒。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A146","t":"衛生主管機關"},{"w":"health campaign","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an organised effort to improve people's health","cn":"健康宣導活動","s":"The city launched a ______ ______ about drinking water instead of bubble tea, and posters appeared in every school.","zh":"市政府推出了一項提倡喝水取代珍珠奶茶的健康宣導活動,每所學校都貼出了海報。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A147","t":"健康宣導活動"},{"w":"health education","pos":"n.phr.","def":"teaching people how to stay healthy","cn":"健康教育","s":"______ ______ classes teach students about sleep and diet, so they can make better choices.","zh":"健康教育課教導學生睡眠和飲食的知識,讓他們能做出更好的選擇。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A148","t":"健康教育"},{"w":"smoking ban","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a law that stops people smoking in certain places","cn":"禁菸令","s":"After the ______ ______ in restaurants, the air inside became much cleaner, and more families came to eat.","zh":"餐廳實施禁菸令後,室內空氣變得乾淨多了,也有更多家庭前來用餐。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A149","t":"禁菸令"},{"w":"second-hand smoke","pos":"n.phr.","def":"smoke breathed in by people near a smoker","cn":"二手菸","s":"______ ______ is dangerous for children, so my uncle now smokes only outside the house.","zh":"二手菸對孩子很危險,所以我舅舅現在只在屋外抽菸。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A150","t":"二手菸"},{"w":"sugar tax","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tax on drinks with a lot of sugar","cn":"糖稅","s":"Several countries introduced a ______ ______ on soft drinks, and companies reduced the sugar to avoid paying it.","zh":"好幾個國家對汽水課徵糖稅,飲料公司便減少糖分以避免繳稅。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A151","t":"糖稅"},{"w":"tobacco","pos":"n.","def":"dried leaves that are smoked in cigarettes","cn":"菸草","s":"The government raised the tax on ________, so the price of cigarettes went up and fewer young people started smoking.","zh":"政府提高了菸草稅,所以香菸價格上漲,開始抽菸的年輕人也變少了。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A152","t":"菸草"},{"w":"nicotine","pos":"n.","def":"the addictive drug in cigarettes","cn":"尼古丁","s":"________ makes smoking very hard to give up, so many people need help from a doctor to quit.","zh":"尼古丁讓人很難戒菸,所以許多人需要醫生的幫助才能戒掉。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A153","t":"尼古丁"},{"w":"e-cigarette","pos":"n.","def":"an electronic device that lets people breathe in nicotine","cn":"電子菸","s":"Selling ________ is now illegal in Taiwan, because health experts worry that they attract teenagers.","zh":"販售電子菸在台灣現在是違法的,因為衛生專家擔心它們會吸引青少年。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A154","t":"電子菸"},{"w":"health warning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a notice that tells people about a danger to health","cn":"健康警語","s":"Every cigarette packet has a large ______ ______ with a picture, but some smokers still ignore it.","zh":"每包香菸上都印有附圖片的大型健康警語,但有些吸菸者仍然視而不見。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A155","t":"健康警語"},{"w":"clean water","pos":"n.phr.","def":"water that is safe to drink","cn":"乾淨的水","s":"Millions of people around the world still have no access to ______ ______, so they often suffer from stomach diseases.","zh":"全世界仍有數百萬人無法取得乾淨的水,所以他們常罹患腸胃疾病。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A156","t":"乾淨的水"},{"w":"waterborne","pos":"adj.","def":"spread by water","cn":"經由水傳播的","s":"After the flood, doctors warned about ________ diseases, so people were told to boil all their drinking water.","zh":"洪水過後醫生警告要注意經由水傳播的疾病,所以民眾被告知要把所有飲用水煮沸。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A157","t":"經由水傳播的"},{"w":"universal health care","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a system that gives medical care to everyone","cn":"全民健康照護","s":"Taiwan's ______ ______ ______ system covers almost every citizen, so even poor families can see a doctor.","zh":"台灣的全民健康照護制度幾乎涵蓋每位國民,所以即使是貧窮家庭也能看醫生。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A158","t":"全民健康照護"},{"w":"healthcare worker","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who works in medical care, such as a nurse","cn":"醫事人員;醫療工作者","s":"______ ______ received the vaccine first, because they were at the highest risk of infection.","zh":"醫療工作者最先接種疫苗,因為他們感染的風險最高。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A159","t":"醫療工作者"},{"w":"frontline","pos":"adj.","def":"working directly in the most important or dangerous place","cn":"第一線的","s":"________ nurses worked twelve-hour shifts during the outbreak, and many of them could not go home for weeks.","zh":"疫情爆發期間第一線護理師輪十二小時的班,其中許多人好幾週無法回家。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A160","t":"第一線"},{"w":"disinfectant","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical that kills germs on surfaces","cn":"消毒劑","s":"The cleaners wipe the door handles with ________ twice a day, so germs do not spread around the school.","zh":"清潔人員每天用消毒劑擦拭門把兩次,讓病菌不會在校園裡傳播。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A161","t":"消毒劑"},{"w":"handwashing","pos":"n.","def":"the act of washing your hands","cn":"洗手","s":"Regular ________ with soap is one of the easiest ways to prevent illness, but many people do it too quickly.","zh":"經常用肥皂洗手是預防疾病最簡單的方法之一,但許多人洗得太快了。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A162","t":"洗手"},{"w":"mosquito net","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a net hung over a bed to keep mosquitoes away","cn":"蚊帳","s":"Charities give families in Africa a ______ ______ for every bed, because it greatly reduces malaria.","zh":"慈善團體為非洲家庭的每張床提供一頂蚊帳,因為它能大幅減少瘧疾。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A163","t":"蚊帳"},{"w":"health inequality","pos":"n.phr.","def":"unfair differences in health between groups of people","cn":"健康不平等","s":"People in remote mountain villages live shorter lives, and this ______ ______ worries the government.","zh":"偏遠山區村莊的居民壽命較短,這種健康不平等讓政府感到憂心。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A164","t":"健康不平等"},{"w":"death rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of deaths in a group in a period of time","cn":"死亡率","s":"The ______ ______ from road accidents fell after the city lowered speed limits, so the plan was seen as a success.","zh":"市政府降低速限後,交通事故的死亡率下降了,所以這項計畫被視為成功。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A165","t":"死亡率"},{"w":"birth rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of babies born in a period of time","cn":"出生率","s":"Taiwan has one of the lowest ______ ______ in the world, so many primary schools have closed in recent years.","zh":"台灣是全世界出生率最低的地方之一,所以近年來許多小學已經關閉。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A166","t":"出生率"},{"w":"infant mortality","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of babies who die before age one","cn":"嬰兒死亡率","s":"______ ______ has dropped sharply in the last fifty years, because more mothers give birth in hospitals.","zh":"過去五十年來嬰兒死亡率大幅下降,因為有更多母親在醫院生產。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A167","t":"嬰兒死亡率"},{"w":"preventive","pos":"adj.","def":"intended to stop something bad from happening","cn":"預防性的","s":"________ medicine saves money in the long run, because treating serious diseases is very expensive.","zh":"預防醫學長期來看能省錢,因為治療重大疾病非常昂貴。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A168","t":"預防"},{"w":"early detection","pos":"n.phr.","def":"finding a disease at an early stage","cn":"早期發現","s":"______ ______ of breast cancer saves many lives, so women over forty-five are offered free scans.","zh":"乳癌的早期發現能拯救許多生命,所以四十五歲以上的女性可以接受免費檢查。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A169","t":"早期發現"},{"w":"rapid test","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a quick test that gives results in minutes","cn":"快篩","s":"I took a ______ ______ at home before visiting my grandmother, because I did not want to give her the virus.","zh":"去探望奶奶之前我在家做了快篩,因為我不想把病毒傳給她。","part":"A","sec":"Public Health & Prevention 公共衛生與預防","lab":"A170","t":"快篩"},{"w":"healthy eating","pos":"n.phr.","def":"choosing food that is good for your body","cn":"健康飲食","s":"Our school promotes ______ ______, so the canteen now serves more vegetables and fewer fried foods.","zh":"我們學校推廣健康飲食,所以餐廳現在供應更多蔬菜、更少油炸食物。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A171","t":"健康飲食"},{"w":"physical activity","pos":"n.phr.","def":"movement of the body, such as walking or sport","cn":"身體活動","s":"Children need at least an hour of ______ ______ every day, but many spend most of their free time on phones.","zh":"孩子每天至少需要一小時的身體活動,但許多人把大部分空閒時間花在手機上。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A172","t":"身體活動"},{"w":"overweight","pos":"adj.","def":"heavier than is healthy","cn":"過重的","s":"The doctor told my uncle that he was ________, so he started walking to work instead of driving.","zh":"醫生告訴我叔叔他體重過重,所以他開始走路上班而不是開車。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A173","t":"過重"},{"w":"underweight","pos":"adj.","def":"lighter than is healthy","cn":"過輕的","s":"Some teenage girls are ________ because they eat too little, so the school nurse talks to them about healthy meals.","zh":"有些少女因為吃得太少而體重過輕,所以學校護理師會和她們談健康的飲食。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A174","t":"過輕"},{"w":"body mass index","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a number based on weight and height used to judge health","cn":"身體質量指數;BMI","s":"Your ______ ______ ______ is calculated from your height and weight, but it does not show how much muscle you have.","zh":"你的身體質量指數是由身高和體重計算出來的,但它無法顯示你有多少肌肉。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A175","t":"身體質量指數"},{"w":"waistline","pos":"n.","def":"the size of the middle of your body","cn":"腰圍","s":"Doctors say a large ________ is a warning sign, because fat around the stomach is linked to heart disease.","zh":"醫生說腰圍過大是一個警訊,因為腹部脂肪與心臟病有關。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A176","t":"腰圍"},{"w":"fast food","pos":"n.phr.","def":"quick, cheap food such as burgers and fries","cn":"速食","s":"Eating ______ ______ every day is bad for your health, but it is popular because it is quick and cheap.","zh":"每天吃速食對健康不好,但它因為又快又便宜而很受歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A177","t":"速食"},{"w":"portion size","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount of food served to one person","cn":"份量","s":"______ ______ in restaurants have grown over the years, so many people eat more than they really need.","zh":"多年來餐廳的份量越來越大,所以許多人吃得比實際需要的更多。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A178","t":"份量"},{"w":"salt","pos":"n.","def":"a white substance used to flavour food","cn":"鹽","s":"Instant noodles contain a lot of ________, so you should not drink all the soup if you have high blood pressure.","zh":"泡麵含有大量的鹽,所以如果你有高血壓,就不應該把湯喝光。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A179","t":"鹽"},{"w":"sleep deprivation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"not getting enough sleep","cn":"睡眠不足","s":"Many high school students suffer from ______ ______, because they study late and use their phones in bed.","zh":"許多高中生睡眠不足,因為他們讀書讀到很晚,又在床上滑手機。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A180","t":"睡眠不足"},{"w":"bedtime","pos":"n.","def":"the time when you usually go to bed","cn":"就寢時間","s":"Experts say you should stop using screens an hour before ________, or you may find it hard to fall asleep.","zh":"專家說你應該在就寢時間前一小時停止使用螢幕,否則可能難以入睡。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A181","t":"就寢時間"},{"w":"step count","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of steps you walk in a day","cn":"步數","s":"My father checks his ______ ______ every evening, and he takes a walk if it is under eight thousand.","zh":"我爸爸每天晚上都會查看他的步數,如果不到八千步他就會出去散步。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A182","t":"步數"},{"w":"tai chi","pos":"n.","def":"a slow Chinese exercise of gentle movements","cn":"太極拳","s":"Every morning a group of seniors practise ______ ______ in the park, because it improves balance and calms the mind.","zh":"每天早上一群長者在公園練太極拳,因為它能改善平衡感並讓心情平靜。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A183","t":"太極拳"},{"w":"health app","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a phone program that tracks your health","cn":"健康應用程式","s":"I use a ______ ______ to record how much water I drink, and it reminds me when I forget.","zh":"我用一個健康應用程式記錄我喝了多少水,我忘記時它會提醒我。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A184","t":"健康應用程式"},{"w":"smartwatch","pos":"n.","def":"a watch that works like a small computer","cn":"智慧手錶","s":"My mother's ________ measures her heart rate while she sleeps, so she knows how well she rested.","zh":"我媽媽的智慧手錶會在她睡覺時測量心率,所以她知道自己休息得好不好。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A185","t":"智慧手錶"},{"w":"mental health","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the health of a person's mind and feelings","cn":"心理健康","s":"Our school now has a counsellor for ______ ______, because many students feel worried about exams.","zh":"我們學校現在有一位負責心理健康的輔導老師,因為許多學生對考試感到焦慮。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A186","t":"心理健康"},{"w":"sunscreen","pos":"n.","def":"a cream that protects skin from the sun","cn":"防曬乳","s":"Put on ________ before you go to the beach, or your skin may burn badly in the strong sun.","zh":"去海灘前要先擦防曬乳,否則你的皮膚可能在強烈的陽光下嚴重曬傷。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A187","t":"防曬乳"},{"w":"dentist","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who looks after teeth","cn":"牙醫","s":"I visit the ________ every six months, so any small problems with my teeth can be fixed early.","zh":"我每六個月去看一次牙醫,所以牙齒的小問題都能及早處理。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A188","t":"牙醫"},{"w":"dental","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to teeth","cn":"牙齒的","s":"Good ________ health starts in childhood, so parents should help young children brush their teeth.","zh":"良好的牙齒健康從童年開始,所以父母應該幫小孩刷牙。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A189","t":"牙齒"},{"w":"toothache","pos":"n.","def":"a pain in a tooth","cn":"牙痛","s":"I had a terrible ________ during the holiday, but all the dental clinics were closed.","zh":"假期中我牙痛得很厲害,但所有的牙科診所都休診了。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A190","t":"痛"},{"w":"cavity","pos":"n.","def":"a hole in a tooth caused by decay","cn":"蛀牙;齲齒","s":"The dentist found two ________ in my teeth, because I drink too many sweet drinks.","zh":"牙醫在我的牙齒上發現兩顆蛀牙,因為我喝了太多含糖飲料。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A191","t":"蛀牙"},{"w":"floss","pos":"v.","def":"to clean between your teeth with a thin thread","cn":"用牙線清潔","s":"You should ________ every night before bed, because a toothbrush cannot reach between your teeth.","zh":"你應該每晚睡前用牙線清潔,因為牙刷刷不到牙齒之間的縫隙。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A192","t":"用牙線清潔"},{"w":"eyesight","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to see","cn":"視力","s":"Too much screen time can harm your ________, so look at something far away every thirty minutes.","zh":"過長的螢幕時間會傷害你的視力,所以每三十分鐘要看看遠方。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A193","t":"視力"},{"w":"short-sighted","pos":"adj.","def":"able to see near things clearly but not far things","cn":"近視的","s":"More than eighty percent of high school students in Taiwan are ________, so glasses are very common in class.","zh":"台灣超過百分之八十的高中生近視,所以教室裡戴眼鏡的人非常普遍。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A194","t":"近視"},{"w":"myopia","pos":"n.","def":"the condition of being unable to see far things clearly","cn":"近視","s":"Doctors believe that playing outdoors can slow ________ in children, so schools encourage outdoor lessons.","zh":"醫生認為戶外活動可以減緩兒童的近視,所以學校鼓勵在戶外上課。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A195","t":"近視"},{"w":"hearing loss","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a reduced ability to hear","cn":"聽力損失","s":"Listening to loud music with earphones can cause ______ ______, so keep the volume below sixty percent.","zh":"用耳機聽大聲的音樂可能造成聽力損失,所以音量要保持在百分之六十以下。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A196","t":"聽力損失"},{"w":"quit","pos":"v.","def":"to stop doing something, such as smoking","cn":"戒除;停止","s":"My grandfather finally ________ smoking at seventy, and he says he can now climb stairs without stopping.","zh":"我爺爺七十歲時終於戒菸了,他說現在爬樓梯都不用停下來休息。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A197","t":"戒"},{"w":"health-conscious","pos":"adj.","def":"careful about doing things that are good for your health","cn":"注重健康的","s":"More ________ customers are choosing drinks with less sugar, so shops have added new options.","zh":"越來越多注重健康的顧客選擇少糖飲料,所以店家增加了新的選項。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A198","t":"注重健康的"},{"w":"home-cooked","pos":"adj.","def":"made at home rather than bought","cn":"家常的;自己煮的","s":"________ meals usually contain less oil and salt, so my mother cooks dinner even when she is busy.","zh":"自己煮的飯菜通常油和鹽都比較少,所以我媽媽即使很忙也會煮晚餐。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A199","t":"自己煮的"},{"w":"addiction","pos":"n.","def":"a strong need to keep doing or using something harmful","cn":"成癮","s":"Phone ________ is a growing problem among teenagers, so some schools ask students to leave their phones in lockers.","zh":"手機成癮在青少年中是日益嚴重的問題,所以有些學校要求學生把手機放在置物櫃裡。","part":"A","sec":"Healthy Lifestyle & Wellness 健康生活型態","lab":"A200","t":"成癮"},{"w":"adulthood","pos":"n.","def":"the time of life when you are an adult","cn":"成年期","s":"Habits that start in childhood often continue into ________, so it is important to teach children to exercise.","zh":"童年養成的習慣常會延續到成年期,所以教孩子運動很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"成年期"},{"w":"affliction","pos":"n.","def":"something that causes pain or suffering","cn":"苦難;病痛","s":"Back pain is a common ________ among office workers, because they sit at their desks for hours.","zh":"背痛是上班族常見的病痛,因為他們在辦公桌前一坐就是好幾個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"病痛"},{"w":"ailment","pos":"n.","def":"a minor illness","cn":"小病;疾病","s":"The pharmacist can help with small ________ like colds and headaches, so you do not always need to see a doctor.","zh":"藥劑師可以幫忙處理感冒和頭痛這類小病,所以你不一定都要去看醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"小病"},{"w":"allowance","pos":"n.","def":"money given regularly for a special purpose","cn":"津貼;補助","s":"Families who look after a disabled relative can get a monthly ________, but the forms are complicated.","zh":"照顧失能親人的家庭可以領取每月津貼,但申請表格很複雜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"津貼"},{"w":"apprehension","pos":"n.","def":"worry about something that may happen","cn":"憂慮;擔心","s":"Many patients feel some ________ before surgery, so the nurses explain every step to calm them.","zh":"許多病人在手術前會感到些許憂慮,所以護理師會解釋每個步驟來安撫他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"憂慮"},{"w":"detriment","pos":"n.","def":"harm or damage","cn":"損害;傷害","s":"He worked long hours to the ________ of his health, and in the end he became seriously ill.","zh":"他長時間工作,對健康造成損害,最後他病得很重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"損害"},{"w":"disability","pos":"n.","def":"a condition that limits a person's movement or senses","cn":"身心障礙;失能","s":"Buildings should be designed for people with a ________, so ramps and wide doors are now required.","zh":"建築物應該為身心障礙人士設計,所以現在規定要有坡道和寬門。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"身心障礙"},{"w":"discomfort","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of mild pain or being uncomfortable","cn":"不適","s":"You may feel some ________ after the injection, but it usually disappears within a day.","zh":"注射後你可能會感到些許不適,但通常一天內就會消失。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"不適"},{"w":"dissatisfaction","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of not being happy with something","cn":"不滿","s":"There is growing ________ with long waiting times, so the hospital is hiring more doctors.","zh":"民眾對漫長的等候時間越來越不滿,所以醫院正在招募更多醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"不滿"},{"w":"expectancy","pos":"n.","def":"how long something is expected to last","cn":"預期;預期壽命","s":"Life ________ in Taiwan is now over eighty years, but people often spend their last years in poor health.","zh":"台灣的預期壽命現在已超過八十歲,但人們往往在健康不佳中度過最後幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"壽命"},{"w":"fatality","pos":"n.","def":"a death caused by an accident or disease","cn":"死亡;死亡人數","s":"The new road safety rules reduced traffic ________ by twenty percent, and fewer families lost loved ones.","zh":"新的道路安全規定讓交通死亡人數減少了百分之二十,失去親人的家庭也變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"死亡人數"},{"w":"fragility","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being weak and easily broken","cn":"脆弱","s":"The pandemic showed the ________ of the health system, because hospitals quickly ran out of beds.","zh":"疫情顯示出醫療體系的脆弱,因為醫院很快就沒有病床了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"脆弱"},{"w":"infirmity","pos":"n.","def":"physical or mental weakness, especially from old age","cn":"虛弱;病弱","s":"Despite the ________ of old age, my great-grandmother still insists on cooking her own meals, and she refuses any help.","zh":"儘管年老體弱,我曾祖母仍堅持自己煮飯,而且拒絕任何幫忙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"體弱"},{"w":"morbidity","pos":"n.","def":"the rate of illness in a population","cn":"罹病率","s":"Air pollution increases ________ in big cities, so more people visit doctors for breathing problems.","zh":"空氣污染提高了大城市的罹病率,所以更多人因呼吸問題去看醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"罹病率"},{"w":"necessity","pos":"n.","def":"something that you need","cn":"必需品;必要","s":"For older people living alone, a phone that calls for help is a ________, not a luxury, so many families buy one for their grandparents.","zh":"對獨居長者來說,一支能求救的電話是必需品,而不是奢侈品,所以許多家庭會為祖父母買一支。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"必需品"},{"w":"negligence","pos":"n.","def":"failure to take proper care","cn":"疏失;過失","s":"The family sued the hospital for ________, because the nurse gave the patient the wrong medicine.","zh":"那家人控告醫院疏失,因為護理師給病人用錯了藥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"疏失"},{"w":"prevention","pos":"n.","def":"stopping something bad from happening","cn":"預防","s":"The ________ of diabetes is cheaper than treatment, so the government pays for free health checks.","zh":"預防糖尿病比治療便宜,所以政府支付免費健康檢查的費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"預防"},{"w":"remission","pos":"n.","def":"a period when a serious illness becomes less severe","cn":"緩解期","s":"After a year of treatment, her cancer is in ________, but she still has regular check-ups.","zh":"經過一年的治療,她的癌症已進入緩解期,但她仍然定期回診檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"緩解期"},{"w":"sustainability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to continue for a long time","cn":"永續性","s":"Experts question the ________ of the health insurance system, because costs are rising every year.","zh":"專家質疑健保制度的永續性,因為成本每年都在上升。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"永續性"},{"w":"dependency","pos":"n.","def":"the state of needing something or someone too much","cn":"依賴","s":"Doctors try to avoid long-term ________ on sleeping pills, so they suggest other ways to improve sleep.","zh":"醫生盡量避免病人長期依賴安眠藥,所以會建議其他改善睡眠的方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"依賴"},{"w":"disclosure","pos":"n.","def":"making information known","cn":"揭露;公開","s":"The law requires the ________ of side effects, so every medicine box contains a long information sheet.","zh":"法律規定必須揭露副作用,所以每盒藥裡都附有一張很長的說明書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"揭露"},{"w":"endorsement","pos":"n.","def":"public support or approval","cn":"背書;支持","s":"The new exercise programme received an ________ from the health ministry, so many schools adopted it.","zh":"這項新的運動計畫獲得衛福部的背書,所以許多學校採用了它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"背書"},{"w":"enrolment","pos":"n.","def":"the act of officially joining a programme","cn":"登記;報名","s":"________ in the free flu vaccine programme begins in October, and seniors can sign up at any clinic.","zh":"免費流感疫苗計畫的登記從十月開始,長者可以在任何診所報名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"登記"},{"w":"exacerbation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making a problem worse","cn":"惡化;加劇","s":"Cold weather often causes an ________ of asthma, so patients should keep warm in winter.","zh":"寒冷的天氣常導致氣喘惡化,所以病人冬天應該注意保暖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"惡化"},{"w":"inadequacy","pos":"n.","def":"the state of not being good enough","cn":"不足;不充分","s":"The report pointed out the ________ of mental health services in rural areas, because few counsellors work there.","zh":"報告指出鄉村地區心理健康服務的不足,因為那裡很少有輔導人員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"不足"},{"w":"incapacity","pos":"n.","def":"the inability to do something","cn":"無能力;失能","s":"Because of his ________ to walk after the accident, he had to stop working for six months.","zh":"由於車禍後他無法行走,他必須停止工作六個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"無法"},{"w":"inefficiency","pos":"n.","def":"the failure to use time or money well","cn":"效率不彰","s":"Paper records caused great ________ in hospitals, so most of them now use computer systems.","zh":"紙本病歷造成醫院嚴重的效率不彰,所以現在大多數醫院都改用電腦系統。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"效率不彰"},{"w":"intolerance","pos":"n.","def":"the inability of the body to accept certain food or drugs","cn":"不耐;不耐症","s":"My friend has a lactose ________, so she drinks soy milk instead of cow's milk.","zh":"我朋友有乳糖不耐症,所以她喝豆漿而不是牛奶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"不耐症"},{"w":"normality","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being normal","cn":"常態","s":"After two years of the pandemic, life slowly returned to ________, and people travelled abroad again.","zh":"經過兩年的疫情,生活慢慢恢復常態,人們又開始出國旅行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"常態"},{"w":"participation","pos":"n.","def":"taking part in an activity","cn":"參與","s":"________ in the free health check was low, so the city sent buses to take villagers to the clinic.","zh":"免費健康檢查的參與率很低,所以市政府派巴士載村民去診所。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"參與"},{"w":"priority","pos":"n.","def":"something that is more important than other things","cn":"優先事項","s":"Protecting older people was the government's top ________, so they received the vaccine before everyone else.","zh":"保護長者是政府的首要優先事項,所以他們比其他人都先接種疫苗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"優先事項"},{"w":"provider","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that supplies a service","cn":"提供者","s":"The insurance company works with many health care ________, so patients can choose their own clinic.","zh":"這家保險公司與許多醫療照護提供者合作,所以病人可以自己選擇診所。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"提供者"},{"w":"reassurance","pos":"n.","def":"words that make someone feel less worried","cn":"安心;寬慰","s":"The worried mother needed ________ from the doctor, so he explained that the fever was not serious.","zh":"那位擔心的母親需要醫生的寬慰,所以他解釋發燒並不嚴重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"寬慰"},{"w":"recipient","pos":"n.","def":"a person who receives something","cn":"接受者;受贈者","s":"The kidney ________ wrote a thank-you letter to the donor's family, and she said he had given her a new life.","zh":"那位腎臟受贈者寫了一封感謝信給捐贈者的家人,她說他給了她新的生命。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"受贈者"},{"w":"recommendation","pos":"n.","def":"a suggestion about what should be done","cn":"建議","s":"The doctor's ________ was to walk for thirty minutes a day, and my father has followed it carefully.","zh":"醫生的建議是每天走路三十分鐘,我爸爸一直認真遵守。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"建議"},{"w":"reduction","pos":"n.","def":"a decrease in size or amount","cn":"減少;降低","s":"The new law led to a large ________ in smoking, so fewer people now suffer from lung disease.","zh":"新法律使吸菸人口大幅減少,所以現在罹患肺病的人變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"減少"},{"w":"reimbursement","pos":"n.","def":"money paid back to someone","cn":"給付;補償款","s":"You can apply for ________ of your medical costs, but you must keep all the receipts.","zh":"你可以申請醫療費用的給付,但必須保留所有收據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"給付"},{"w":"renewal","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making something valid again","cn":"更新;續約","s":"My grandfather's driving licence ________ required an eye test, because he is now over seventy-five years old.","zh":"我爺爺的駕照更新需要做視力檢查,因為他已經超過七十五歲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"更新"},{"w":"resistance","pos":"n.","def":"the ability of germs to survive a drug","cn":"抗藥性;抵抗力","s":"Taking antibiotics too often can lead to ________, so the medicine may not work when you really need it.","zh":"太常服用抗生素會導致抗藥性,所以當你真正需要時藥可能就沒效了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"抗藥性"},{"w":"suspension","pos":"n.","def":"stopping something for a period of time","cn":"暫停;停職","s":"The hospital announced the ________ of visits during the outbreak, so families talked to patients by video.","zh":"醫院宣布疫情期間暫停探病,所以家屬透過視訊和病人交談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"暫停"},{"w":"affluence","pos":"n.","def":"the state of having a lot of money","cn":"富裕","s":"Growing ________ has changed people's diets, so diseases like diabetes have become much more common in Asia.","zh":"日益富裕改變了人們的飲食,所以像糖尿病這樣的疾病在亞洲變得更加普遍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"富裕"},{"w":"complication","pos":"n.","def":"a new medical problem that makes an illness worse","cn":"併發症","s":"The operation went well, but a ________ developed afterwards, so she stayed in hospital longer.","zh":"手術很順利,但術後出現了併發症,所以她在醫院待得比較久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"併發症"},{"w":"disorder","pos":"n.","def":"an illness of the mind or body","cn":"失調;疾病","s":"He was diagnosed with a sleep ________, so he now sleeps with a machine that helps him breathe.","zh":"他被診斷出睡眠障礙,所以他現在睡覺時使用一台幫助呼吸的機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"障礙"},{"w":"disruption","pos":"n.","def":"a problem that stops something from continuing normally","cn":"中斷;干擾","s":"The typhoon caused serious ________ to hospital services, and some operations had to be cancelled.","zh":"颱風對醫院服務造成嚴重中斷,有些手術必須取消。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"中斷"},{"w":"inequity","pos":"n.","def":"unfairness","cn":"不公平","s":"There is clear ________ in access to doctors, because rural towns have far fewer clinics than cities.","zh":"在就醫機會上存在明顯的不公平,因為鄉鎮的診所遠少於城市。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"不公平"},{"w":"standard","pos":"n.","def":"a level of quality","cn":"標準;水準","s":"The ________ of care in this nursing home is very high, so there is a long waiting list.","zh":"這間護理之家的照護水準非常高,所以候補名單很長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"水準"},{"w":"acceptance","pos":"n.","def":"the act of agreeing to or believing in something","cn":"接受","s":"Public ________ of the new vaccine was slow at first, but it grew as more people got it safely.","zh":"大眾對新疫苗的接受度一開始很低,但隨著越來越多人安全接種而逐漸提高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"接受"},{"w":"agreement","pos":"n.","def":"a situation in which people share the same opinion","cn":"共識;同意","s":"There is general ________ among doctors that sugary drinks harm children, so schools no longer sell them.","zh":"醫生們普遍同意含糖飲料對孩子有害,所以學校不再販售它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"同意"},{"w":"approval","pos":"n.","def":"official permission","cn":"核准;批准","s":"The new drug needs government ________ before doctors can use it, so testing may take several years.","zh":"新藥需要政府核准醫生才能使用,所以測試可能要花好幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"核准"},{"w":"commencement","pos":"n.","def":"the beginning of something","cn":"開始","s":"Patients must stop eating twelve hours before the ________ of the operation, or it will be delayed.","zh":"病人必須在手術開始前十二小時禁食,否則手術會延後。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"開始"},{"w":"confidentiality","pos":"n.","def":"keeping information private","cn":"保密","s":"Doctors must respect patient ________, so they cannot share your health information without your permission.","zh":"醫生必須遵守病人資料保密,所以他們不能未經允許分享你的健康資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"保密"},{"w":"continuation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of carrying on with something","cn":"持續;延續","s":"The ________ of the free school lunch programme depends on next year's budget, so parents are worried.","zh":"免費營養午餐計畫能否延續取決於明年的預算,所以家長們很擔心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"延續"},{"w":"decrease","pos":"n.","def":"a reduction in amount or number","cn":"減少;下降","s":"There has been a steady ________ in smoking among teenagers, and experts credit the higher prices.","zh":"青少年吸菸人數持續下降,專家認為這要歸功於價格上漲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"下降"},{"w":"delivery","pos":"n.","def":"the act of providing a service","cn":"提供;遞送","s":"The ________ of health services in mountain areas is difficult, so doctors sometimes travel by helicopter.","zh":"在山區提供醫療服務很困難,所以醫生有時要搭直升機前往。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"提供"},{"w":"enforcement","pos":"n.","def":"making sure a law is obeyed","cn":"執法;執行","s":"Stricter ________ of the smoking ban means that shops selling to teenagers now face large fines, so fewer teenagers can buy cigarettes.","zh":"更嚴格地執行禁菸令意味著販售給青少年的商店現在會面臨高額罰款,所以能買到香菸的青少年變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"執行"},{"w":"establishment","pos":"n.","def":"the act of starting an organisation","cn":"設立;建立","s":"The ________ of a new hospital in the town means residents no longer have to travel two hours for treatment, so the whole town celebrated.","zh":"鎮上設立了一間新醫院,這表示居民不必再花兩小時去看病,所以全鎮都在慶祝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"設立"},{"w":"facility","pos":"n.","def":"a building or place for a particular purpose","cn":"設施","s":"The new care ________ has a garden and a gym, so residents can stay active every day.","zh":"新的照護設施有花園和健身房,所以住民每天都能保持活動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"設施"},{"w":"fulfilment","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of happiness from doing something useful","cn":"滿足感;成就感","s":"Many retirees find ________ in volunteer work, and studies show that they also tend to live longer.","zh":"許多退休人士在志工工作中找到成就感,研究也顯示他們往往活得更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"成就感"},{"w":"governance","pos":"n.","def":"the way an organisation is controlled and managed","cn":"治理","s":"Poor ________ at the hospital led to serious mistakes, so the director was replaced last month.","zh":"醫院治理不善導致嚴重錯誤,所以院長上個月被撤換了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"治理"},{"w":"increment","pos":"n.","def":"a small increase","cn":"增量;增額","s":"The dose is raised in small ________ each week, so the body has time to get used to the medicine.","zh":"劑量每週以小幅增量提高,讓身體有時間適應藥物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"增量"},{"w":"insurer","pos":"n.","def":"a company that provides insurance","cn":"保險公司","s":"My ________ refused to pay for the treatment, because they said it was only for beauty, not health.","zh":"我的保險公司拒絕給付這項治療,因為他們說這只是為了美容,不是為了健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"保險公司"},{"w":"objection","pos":"n.","def":"a reason for not agreeing","cn":"反對;異議","s":"Some parents raised an ________ to the new vaccine rule, but most families supported it.","zh":"有些家長對新的疫苗規定提出異議,但大多數家庭都支持。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"異議"},{"w":"precondition","pos":"n.","def":"something that must happen before something else","cn":"先決條件","s":"Good sleep is a ________ for good health, so doctors ask about sleep at every check-up.","zh":"良好的睡眠是健康的先決條件,所以醫生每次檢查都會詢問睡眠情況。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"先決條件"},{"w":"readiness","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being prepared","cn":"準備就緒","s":"The drill tested the hospital's ________ for a major earthquake, and the staff responded quickly.","zh":"這次演習測試了醫院對大地震的準備程度,工作人員反應迅速。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"準備程度"},{"w":"refusal","pos":"n.","def":"saying no to something","cn":"拒絕","s":"His ________ to take the medicine worried his family, so they asked the doctor to talk to him.","zh":"他拒絕吃藥讓家人很擔心,所以他們請醫生和他談談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"拒絕"},{"w":"replacement","pos":"n.","def":"a new part that takes the place of an old one","cn":"置換;替代品","s":"My grandmother had a knee ________ last spring, and now she can walk to the market without pain.","zh":"我奶奶去年春天做了膝關節置換手術,現在她走路去市場都不會痛了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"置換"},{"w":"afflict","pos":"v.","def":"to cause pain or suffering to someone","cn":"折磨;使受苦","s":"Back problems ________ millions of office workers, so many companies now buy standing desks for their staff.","zh":"背部問題折磨著數百萬上班族,所以許多公司現在為員工購買站立式辦公桌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"折磨"},{"w":"prolong","pos":"v.","def":"to make something last longer","cn":"延長","s":"Regular exercise can ________ your healthy years, so it is never too late to start moving.","zh":"規律運動可以延長你的健康年歲,所以開始動起來永遠不嫌晚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"延長"},{"w":"subsidise","pos":"v.","def":"to pay part of the cost of something","cn":"補助;補貼","s":"The government will ________ hearing aids for older people, so they will cost much less.","zh":"政府將補助長者購買助聽器,所以價格會便宜很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"補助"},{"w":"reimburse","pos":"v.","def":"to pay back money someone has spent","cn":"償還;給付","s":"The company will ________ the cost of your health check, but you must send the receipt within a month.","zh":"公司會給付你的健檢費用,但你必須在一個月內寄回收據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"給付"},{"w":"overburden","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone or something too much work","cn":"使負擔過重","s":"The flu outbreak may ________ local hospitals, so people with mild symptoms should stay at home.","zh":"流感爆發可能會使地方醫院負擔過重,所以症狀輕微的人應該待在家裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"使 負擔過重"},{"w":"worsen","pos":"v.","def":"to become worse","cn":"惡化","s":"His cough began to ________ after a week, so he finally went to the doctor.","zh":"一週後他的咳嗽開始惡化,所以他終於去看醫生了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"惡化"},{"w":"overstretch","pos":"v.","def":"to make a system try to do more than it can","cn":"使不堪負荷","s":"Too many patients can ________ a small hospital, and then the quality of care drops.","zh":"太多病人可能會使一間小醫院不堪負荷,接著照護品質就會下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"使 不堪負荷"},{"w":"endanger","pos":"v.","def":"to put someone in danger","cn":"危及","s":"Driving after taking strong cold medicine can ________ other road users, because it makes you sleepy.","zh":"服用強效感冒藥後開車可能危及其他用路人,因為它會讓你想睡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"危及"},{"w":"prevent","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from happening","cn":"預防;防止","s":"Washing your hands often can ________ many infections, so teachers remind students to do it before lunch.","zh":"經常洗手可以預防許多感染,所以老師會在午餐前提醒學生洗手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"預防"},{"w":"recommend","pos":"v.","def":"to advise that something should be done","cn":"建議","s":"Doctors ________ at least seven hours of sleep a night, but many teenagers get much less.","zh":"醫生建議每晚至少睡七個小時,但許多青少年睡得少得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"建議"},{"w":"reduce","pos":"v.","def":"to make something smaller or less","cn":"減少;降低","s":"Eating more vegetables can ________ the risk of heart disease, so try to fill half your plate with them.","zh":"多吃蔬菜可以降低罹患心臟病的風險,所以試著讓蔬菜佔你餐盤的一半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"降低"},{"w":"immunise","pos":"v.","def":"to protect someone from disease, usually with a vaccine","cn":"使免疫;為……預防注射","s":"The programme aims to ________ every child against measles, so nurses visit even remote villages.","zh":"這項計畫的目標是為每個孩子接種麻疹疫苗,所以護理師連偏遠村莊都會前往。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"為 接種"},{"w":"assist","pos":"v.","def":"to help","cn":"協助","s":"Volunteers ________ older patients at the hospital entrance, and they show them where to register.","zh":"志工在醫院入口協助年長病人,並告訴他們在哪裡掛號。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"協助"},{"w":"shorten","pos":"v.","def":"to make something shorter","cn":"縮短","s":"Smoking can ________ your life by ten years, but quitting at any age brings real benefits.","zh":"吸菸可能縮短你十年的壽命,但任何年紀戒菸都能帶來實際的好處。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"縮短"},{"w":"supervise","pos":"v.","def":"to watch over someone to make sure they act correctly","cn":"監督;督導","s":"A senior doctor must ________ new doctors during their first year, so patients stay safe.","zh":"資深醫師必須在新進醫師第一年期間督導他們,以確保病人安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"督導"},{"w":"stagnate","pos":"v.","def":"to stop developing or growing","cn":"停滯","s":"Life expectancy began to ________ in some countries, and experts blamed poor diets and stress.","zh":"某些國家的平均壽命開始停滯,專家將原因歸咎於不良飲食和壓力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"停滯"},{"w":"skyrocket","pos":"v.","def":"to increase very quickly","cn":"暴漲;飆升","s":"The price of face masks began to ________ at the start of the pandemic, so the government set a fixed price.","zh":"疫情剛開始時口罩價格開始飆升,所以政府訂定了固定價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"飆升"},{"w":"halve","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce something by half","cn":"減半","s":"Regular exercise can ________ the risk of some diseases, so it is one of the best medicines we have.","zh":"規律運動可以使某些疾病的風險減半,所以它是我們擁有的最好的藥之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"減半"},{"w":"hospitalise","pos":"v.","def":"to send someone to hospital for treatment","cn":"使住院","s":"More than one hundred children were ________ with flu last month, so schools were asked to clean classrooms daily.","zh":"上個月有一百多名兒童因流感住院,所以學校被要求每天清潔教室。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"住院"},{"w":"counsel","pos":"v.","def":"to give advice to someone about their problems","cn":"輔導;提供諮詢","s":"Nurses ________ new mothers on how to feed their babies, and they also visit them at home.","zh":"護理師輔導新手媽媽如何餵養嬰兒,也會到家裡訪視她們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"輔導"},{"w":"inform","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone facts","cn":"告知;通知","s":"Doctors must ________ patients about the risks of an operation, so they can make a careful decision.","zh":"醫生必須告知病人手術的風險,讓他們能審慎做決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"告知"},{"w":"effective","pos":"adj.","def":"producing the result that you want","cn":"有效的","s":"The new flu vaccine is very ________, so doctors expect far fewer hospital visits this winter.","zh":"新的流感疫苗非常有效,所以醫生預期今年冬天就醫人數會少很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"有效"},{"w":"ailing","pos":"adj.","def":"ill or in a weak condition","cn":"生病的;每況愈下的","s":"She moved back to her hometown to look after her ________ mother, and she found a part-time job nearby.","zh":"她搬回家鄉照顧生病的母親,並在附近找了一份兼職工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"生病的"},{"w":"compassionate","pos":"adj.","def":"showing kindness and care for people who suffer","cn":"有同情心的","s":"Patients love Dr. Lin because she is so ________, and she always takes time to listen.","zh":"病人們很喜歡林醫師,因為她非常有同情心,總是花時間傾聽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"有同情心"},{"w":"critical","pos":"adj.","def":"very serious and dangerous","cn":"危急的;嚴重的","s":"The injured driver was in a ________ condition, so he was taken straight to the operating theatre.","zh":"受傷的駕駛情況危急,所以被直接送進手術室。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"危急"},{"w":"dysfunctional","pos":"adj.","def":"not working normally or properly","cn":"失能的;運作不良的","s":"Critics say the ________ system wastes money, because patients see several doctors for the same problem.","zh":"批評者說這個運作不良的制度浪費金錢,因為病人為了同一個問題看好幾位醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"運作不良的"},{"w":"escalating","pos":"adj.","def":"increasing quickly","cn":"不斷升高的","s":"The ________ cost of medicine worries many families, so they are asking the government for help.","zh":"不斷升高的藥價讓許多家庭擔憂,所以他們向政府請求協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"不斷升高的"},{"w":"feeble","pos":"adj.","def":"very weak","cn":"虛弱的;無力的","s":"After weeks in bed, my grandfather felt ________, so a physiotherapist helped him walk again.","zh":"臥床幾週後,我爺爺覺得很虛弱,所以一位物理治療師幫助他重新走路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"虛弱"},{"w":"hygienic","pos":"adj.","def":"clean and free of germs","cn":"衛生的","s":"The night market stall looks ________, because the cook wears gloves and covers all the food.","zh":"這個夜市攤位看起來很衛生,因為廚師戴著手套並把所有食物都蓋起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"衛生"},{"w":"inactive","pos":"adj.","def":"not doing much physical activity","cn":"不活動的;缺乏活動的","s":"People who stay ________ for long periods lose muscle quickly, so even short walks can help.","zh":"長時間缺乏活動的人肌肉流失很快,所以即使短距離散步也有幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"缺乏活動"},{"w":"life-threatening","pos":"adj.","def":"able to cause death","cn":"危及生命的","s":"A peanut allergy can be ________, so Mia always carries an emergency pen in her bag.","zh":"花生過敏可能危及生命,所以米亞總是在包包裡帶著緊急注射筆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"危及生命"},{"w":"malignant","pos":"adj.","def":"(of a tumour) dangerous and likely to spread","cn":"惡性的","s":"The doctor was relieved that the lump was not ________, so the patient did not need cancer treatment.","zh":"醫生鬆了一口氣,因為那個腫塊不是惡性的,所以病人不需要接受癌症治療。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"惡性的"},{"w":"mild","pos":"adj.","def":"not serious or strong","cn":"輕微的","s":"Most people with the virus have only ________ symptoms, but older people may become very ill.","zh":"大多數感染病毒的人只有輕微的症狀,但長者可能會病得很重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"輕微的"},{"w":"nutritional","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the food you need to be healthy","cn":"營養的","s":"The school lunch must meet ________ standards, so a dietitian plans the menu every month.","zh":"學校午餐必須符合營養標準,所以營養師每個月都會規劃菜單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"營養"},{"w":"obese","pos":"adj.","def":"very overweight in a way that is unhealthy","cn":"肥胖的","s":"The number of ________ children has increased, so schools now offer more after-school sports clubs.","zh":"肥胖兒童的人數增加了,所以學校現在提供更多課後運動社團。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"肥胖"},{"w":"overburdened","pos":"adj.","def":"having too much work or too many problems","cn":"負擔過重的","s":"________ nurses often quit their jobs, so the hospital is trying to reduce their working hours.","zh":"負擔過重的護理師常常辭職,所以醫院正試著縮短她們的工時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"負擔過重的"},{"w":"overstretched","pos":"adj.","def":"having too much to do with too few resources","cn":"不堪負荷的","s":"The emergency room was ________ during the holiday, and some patients waited more than six hours to see a doctor.","zh":"假期期間急診室不堪負荷,有些病人等了超過六個小時才看到醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"不堪負荷"},{"w":"physiological","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to how the body works","cn":"生理的","s":"Stress causes ________ changes like a faster heartbeat, so it can affect your health over time.","zh":"壓力會引起心跳加快等生理變化,所以長期下來會影響你的健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"生理"},{"w":"precautionary","pos":"adj.","def":"done to avoid possible danger","cn":"預防性的;防範的","s":"As a ________ measure, the school closed for two days, although only three students were sick.","zh":"作為防範措施,學校停課兩天,儘管只有三名學生生病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"防範"},{"w":"rehabilitative","pos":"adj.","def":"helping someone return to normal life after illness","cn":"復健的","s":"After the stroke, he joined a ________ programme, and he can now use his right hand again.","zh":"中風後他參加了一項復健計畫,現在他的右手又能使用了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"復健"},{"w":"sanitary","pos":"adj.","def":"clean and not likely to cause disease","cn":"衛生的;衛生設備的","s":"Poor ________ conditions in the camp led to an outbreak of disease, so aid groups sent clean water.","zh":"營區衛生條件差導致疾病爆發,所以救援團體送來了乾淨的水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"衛生"},{"w":"subsidised","pos":"adj.","def":"partly paid for by the government","cn":"受補助的","s":"Seniors can join ________ exercise classes at the community centre, so each lesson costs only fifty dollars.","zh":"長者可以參加社區中心受補助的運動課程,所以每堂課只要五十元。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"受補助的"},{"w":"terminal","pos":"adj.","def":"(of an illness) leading to death","cn":"末期的","s":"When her father was diagnosed with ________ cancer, she took leave from work to spend time with him.","zh":"當她父親被診斷出末期癌症時,她向公司請假陪伴他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"末期"},{"w":"unhealthy","pos":"adj.","def":"bad for your health","cn":"不健康的","s":"Many convenience store snacks are ________, so I try to bring fruit to school instead.","zh":"許多便利商店的零食都不健康,所以我盡量改帶水果到學校。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"不健康"},{"w":"unhygienic","pos":"adj.","def":"dirty and likely to spread disease","cn":"不衛生的","s":"The restaurant kitchen was so ________ that inspectors closed it, and its regular customers were shocked by the news.","zh":"那家餐廳的廚房非常不衛生,所以稽查員勒令它停業,常客們聽到消息都很震驚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"不衛生"},{"w":"untreated","pos":"adj.","def":"not given medical care","cn":"未經治療的","s":"If high blood pressure is left ________, it can lead to a stroke, so regular checks are important.","zh":"如果高血壓未經治療,可能導致中風,所以定期檢查很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"未經治療"},{"w":"clinical","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the treatment of patients","cn":"臨床的","s":"The nursing students spend their final year in ________ training, so they learn by working with real patients.","zh":"護理系學生在最後一年進行臨床訓練,所以他們透過照顧真正的病人來學習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"臨床"},{"w":"curable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be cured","cn":"可治癒的","s":"Many types of cancer are ________ if they are found early, so regular screening saves lives.","zh":"許多類型的癌症若及早發現是可治癒的,所以定期篩檢能救命。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"可治癒的"},{"w":"treatable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be treated with medicine or therapy","cn":"可治療的","s":"Depression is a ________ illness, so people who feel low for weeks should ask for help.","zh":"憂鬱症是一種可治療的疾病,所以情緒低落好幾週的人應該尋求協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"可治療的"},{"w":"non-invasive","pos":"adj.","def":"not needing to cut or enter the body","cn":"非侵入性的","s":"The new scan is ________, so patients can go home right after it without any pain.","zh":"這種新的掃描是非侵入性的,所以病人做完後馬上就能回家,也不會痛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"非侵入性的"},{"w":"underfunded","pos":"adj.","def":"not given enough money","cn":"資金不足的","s":"Mental health services are ________ in many countries, so patients wait several months for professional help.","zh":"許多國家的心理健康服務資金不足,所以病人要等好幾個月才能得到專業協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"資金不足"},{"w":"unmet","pos":"adj.","def":"not satisfied or provided","cn":"未被滿足的","s":"There is a large ________ need for dental care in rural areas, because few dentists want to work there.","zh":"鄉村地區有大量未被滿足的牙科照護需求,因為很少牙醫願意在那裡工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"未被滿足的"},{"w":"unaffordable","pos":"adj.","def":"too expensive to pay for","cn":"負擔不起的","s":"The new medicine is ________ for most families, so doctors hope insurance will cover it soon.","zh":"這種新藥對大多數家庭來說是負擔不起的,所以醫生希望保險很快能給付。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"負擔不起的"},{"w":"involuntary","pos":"adj.","def":"done without choosing to","cn":"不自主的;非自願的","s":"Sneezing is an ________ action, so you cannot stop it, but you can cover your mouth.","zh":"打噴嚏是一種不自主的動作,所以你無法阻止它,但你可以遮住嘴巴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"不自主的"},{"w":"short-lived","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only a short time","cn":"短暫的","s":"The benefits of crash diets are ________, because most people regain the weight within a year.","zh":"速成節食的效果是短暫的,因為大多數人一年內就會復胖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"短暫的"},{"w":"long-lasting","pos":"adj.","def":"continuing for a long time","cn":"持久的","s":"Good habits that you build as a teenager have ________ effects, so start exercising regularly while you are young.","zh":"青少年時期養成的好習慣有持久的效果,所以趁年輕開始規律運動吧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"持久的"},{"w":"nationwide","pos":"adj.","def":"happening in all parts of a country","cn":"全國性的","s":"The government launched a ________ campaign against smoking, and adverts appeared on every TV channel.","zh":"政府發起了一項全國性的反菸運動,每個電視頻道都出現了廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"全國性的"},{"w":"worldwide","pos":"adj.","def":"happening all over the world","cn":"全世界的","s":"The ________ spread of the virus shocked everyone, because it reached almost every country within months.","zh":"病毒在全世界的擴散震驚了所有人,因為它在幾個月內就傳到了幾乎每個國家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"全世界的"},{"w":"sudden","pos":"adj.","def":"happening quickly and unexpectedly","cn":"突然的","s":"A ________ pain in the chest can be a sign of a heart attack, so call an ambulance immediately.","zh":"胸口突然的疼痛可能是心臟病發作的徵兆,所以要立即叫救護車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"突然的"},{"w":"steady","pos":"adj.","def":"developing gradually and evenly","cn":"穩定的;持續的","s":"There has been a ________ rise in the number of people over eighty, so more care homes are needed.","zh":"八十歲以上的人數持續增加,所以需要更多照護機構。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"持續"},{"w":"slight","pos":"adj.","def":"small in degree","cn":"輕微的","s":"I had a ________ headache after the vaccine, but it went away after a short nap.","zh":"打完疫苗後我有輕微的頭痛,但小睡一下就好了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"輕微的"},{"w":"optional","pos":"adj.","def":"that you can choose to do or not","cn":"可選擇的;非強制的","s":"The flu vaccine is ________ for students, but the school strongly encourages everyone to get it.","zh":"流感疫苗對學生來說是自由選擇的,但學校強烈鼓勵每個人都去接種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"自由選擇的"},{"w":"adequately","pos":"adv.","def":"well enough","cn":"充分地;適當地","s":"Many older people do not drink ________ in summer, so they can become ill in the heat.","zh":"許多長者夏天沒有充分地喝水,所以在炎熱中可能會生病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"充分地"},{"w":"alarmingly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that causes worry","cn":"令人擔憂地","s":"The number of children with myopia is ________ high, so doctors want students to spend more time outdoors.","zh":"近視兒童的人數高得令人擔憂,所以醫生希望學生多花時間在戶外。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"高得令人擔憂"},{"w":"chronically","pos":"adv.","def":"for a long time and not easily cured","cn":"長期地","s":"________ ill patients often visit the hospital every month, so they get to know the nurses well.","zh":"長期患病的病人常常每個月都去醫院,所以他們和護理師都很熟。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"長期"},{"w":"disproportionately","pos":"adv.","def":"too much or too little compared with others","cn":"不成比例地","s":"The heatwave ________ affected older people living alone, because many of them had no air-conditioning at home.","zh":"熱浪不成比例地影響了獨居長者,因為他們許多人家裡沒有冷氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"不成比例地"},{"w":"equitably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a fair way","cn":"公平地","s":"The vaccines should be shared ________ between rich and poor countries, but this did not always happen.","zh":"疫苗應該在富國和窮國之間公平地分配,但這並非總是如此。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"公平地"},{"w":"moderately","pos":"adv.","def":"to an average degree; not too much","cn":"適度地","s":"Experts say you should exercise ________ most days, so a fast walk counts as good exercise.","zh":"專家說大多數日子你都應該適度地運動,所以快走也算是很好的運動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"適度地"},{"w":"rapidly","pos":"adv.","def":"very quickly","cn":"迅速地","s":"The virus spread ________ through the cruise ship, because passengers ate and danced together every night.","zh":"病毒在郵輪上迅速地傳播,因為乘客們每晚都一起用餐跳舞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"迅速地"},{"w":"severely","pos":"adv.","def":"very badly or seriously","cn":"嚴重地","s":"Several workers were ________ injured in the fire, and they were taken to three different hospitals.","zh":"好幾名工人在火災中嚴重受傷,他們被送往三間不同的醫院。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"嚴重"},{"w":"sufficiently","pos":"adv.","def":"enough","cn":"充分地;足夠地","s":"If you do not sleep ________, your body cannot fight infections well, so you catch colds more often.","zh":"如果你睡得不夠,身體就無法有效對抗感染,所以你會更常感冒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"夠"},{"w":"unnecessarily","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is not needed","cn":"不必要地","s":"Some patients visit the emergency room ________, so people who are really sick must wait longer.","zh":"有些病人不必要地跑急診,所以真正病重的人必須等更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"不必要地"},{"w":"routinely","pos":"adv.","def":"as a normal part of a process","cn":"例行地;常規地","s":"Babies are ________ checked for hearing problems after birth, so any issues can be treated early.","zh":"嬰兒出生後會例行接受聽力檢查,所以任何問題都能及早治療。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"例行"},{"w":"prematurely","pos":"adv.","def":"too early","cn":"過早地","s":"Smoking makes your skin age ________, so many young smokers look older than they are.","zh":"吸菸會讓你的皮膚過早老化,所以許多年輕吸菸者看起來比實際年齡老。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"過早"},{"w":"voluntarily","pos":"adv.","def":"by your own choice","cn":"自願地","s":"Many people ________ stayed at home during the outbreak, although the government did not order a lockdown.","zh":"疫情爆發期間許多人自願待在家裡,雖然政府並沒有下令封城。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"自願"},{"w":"independently","pos":"adv.","def":"without help from others","cn":"獨立地","s":"The aim of rehabilitation is to help patients live ________, so they can cook and shop by themselves.","zh":"復健的目標是幫助病人獨立生活,讓他們能自己煮飯和購物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"獨立"},{"w":"physically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that relates to the body","cn":"身體上","s":"My grandmother is still ________ strong at eighty, but she sometimes forgets the names of people she has met.","zh":"我奶奶八十歲了身體仍然很硬朗,但她有時會忘記見過的人的名字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"身體"},{"w":"medically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that relates to medicine","cn":"醫學上","s":"The boy was declared ________ fit to play again, so he rejoined the team after three months.","zh":"那個男孩被判定醫學上已適合再度上場,所以三個月後他重返球隊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"醫學上"},{"w":"clinically","pos":"adv.","def":"according to medical tests or treatment","cn":"臨床上","s":"The cream has been ________ tested on thousands of people, so the company says it is safe.","zh":"這種乳霜已在數千人身上經過臨床測試,所以公司說它是安全的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"臨床"},{"w":"nationally","pos":"adv.","def":"across the whole country","cn":"全國地","s":"The health programme started in Taipei, but it will be offered ________ from next year.","zh":"這項健康計畫從台北開始,但明年起將在全國推行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"全國"},{"w":"regularly","pos":"adv.","def":"often and at even times","cn":"定期地;經常地","s":"If you check your blood pressure ________, you can notice problems before they become serious.","zh":"如果你定期量血壓,就能在問題變嚴重前發現它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"定期"},{"w":"temporarily","pos":"adv.","def":"for a short time only","cn":"暫時地","s":"The clinic is ________ closed for repairs, so patients must go to the hospital until next month.","zh":"診所因整修暫時關閉,所以病人在下個月前必須到醫院就診。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"暫時"},{"w":"permanently","pos":"adv.","def":"for all time","cn":"永久地","s":"Loud noise at work can ________ damage your hearing, so factory workers must wear ear protection.","zh":"工作場所的噪音可能永久地傷害你的聽力,所以工廠工人必須配戴護耳設備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"永久地"},{"w":"directly","pos":"adv.","def":"without anything in between","cn":"直接地","s":"The new app sends test results ________ to your phone, so you do not need to return to the clinic.","zh":"新的應用程式會把檢驗結果直接傳到你的手機,所以你不必再回診所。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"直接"},{"w":"noticeably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is easy to see","cn":"明顯地","s":"After a month of walking every day, my father looked ________ healthier, and he slept better too.","zh":"每天走路一個月後,我爸爸看起來明顯更健康了,睡得也更好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"明顯"},{"w":"slightly","pos":"adv.","def":"a little","cn":"稍微地","s":"My temperature was ________ high this morning, so I stayed at home and rested all day.","zh":"我今天早上的體溫稍微偏高,所以我待在家休息一整天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"稍微"},{"w":"proportionately","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that matches the size of something","cn":"按比例地","s":"As the number of patients grows, the number of nurses should increase ________, but this rarely happens.","zh":"隨著病人數量增加,護理師的人數應該按比例增加,但這很少發生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"按比例"},{"w":"optimally","pos":"adv.","def":"in the best possible way","cn":"最佳地","s":"To work ________, the brain needs both sleep and water, so do not skip either before an exam.","zh":"大腦要最佳地運作,需要睡眠和水分,所以考試前兩者都不要省略。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"最佳地"},{"w":"efficiently","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that does not waste time or money","cn":"有效率地","s":"The new booking system helps the clinic run more ________, so patients spend less time waiting.","zh":"新的預約系統幫助診所更有效率地運作,所以病人等待的時間減少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"有效率地"},{"w":"affordably","pos":"adv.","def":"at a price people can pay","cn":"價格合理地","s":"The charity provides glasses ________ to poor families, and some children can read the board for the first time.","zh":"這個慈善團體以合理的價格為貧困家庭提供眼鏡,有些孩子第一次能看清黑板。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"合理的價格"},{"w":"persistently","pos":"adv.","def":"continuing for a long time","cn":"持續地","s":"If you feel ________ tired for weeks, you should see a doctor, because it may be a sign of illness.","zh":"如果你連續幾週持續感到疲倦,應該去看醫生,因為那可能是疾病的徵兆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"持續"},{"w":"predictably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that was expected","cn":"可想而知地","s":"________, flu cases rose after the long holiday, because many people had travelled and met relatives.","zh":"可想而知,長假過後流感病例增加了,因為許多人去旅行並與親戚相聚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"可想而知"},{"w":"promptly","pos":"adv.","def":"quickly and without delay","cn":"迅速地;立即地","s":"Burns should be cooled ________ under running water, so the skin is not damaged further.","zh":"燙傷應該立即用流動的水沖涼,這樣皮膚才不會進一步受損。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"立即"},{"w":"reliably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that can be trusted","cn":"可靠地","s":"The test can ________ detect the virus within fifteen minutes, so it is used at airports.","zh":"這種檢測能在十五分鐘內可靠地驗出病毒,所以被用於機場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"可靠地"},{"w":"safely","pos":"adv.","def":"without danger","cn":"安全地","s":"The hospital must dispose of used needles ________, or the cleaners who empty the bins could be badly injured.","zh":"醫院必須安全地處理用過的針頭,否則清倒垃圾桶的清潔人員可能會嚴重受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"安全地"},{"w":"sustainably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that can continue for a long time","cn":"永續地","s":"The health system must be funded ________, or there will not be enough money when we are old.","zh":"醫療體系必須被永續地籌資,否則等我們老了就沒有足夠的錢了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"永續地"},{"w":"adequacy","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being good or enough","cn":"適足性;充分","s":"Researchers checked the ________ of school lunches, and they found that many lacked enough vegetables.","zh":"研究人員檢查了學校午餐的充分性,發現許多午餐蔬菜不足。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"充分性"},{"w":"equality","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being equal","cn":"平等","s":"The charity works for ________ in health care, so that poor families receive the same treatment as rich ones.","zh":"這個慈善團體致力於醫療平等,讓貧困家庭獲得和富裕家庭相同的治療。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"平等"},{"w":"infringement","pos":"n.","def":"an action that breaks a rule or law","cn":"侵犯;違反","s":"Sharing a patient's photo online is an ________ of privacy, so the nurse was punished.","zh":"在網路上分享病人的照片是侵犯隱私的行為,所以那名護理師受到了處分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"侵犯"},{"w":"inspection","pos":"n.","def":"an official check","cn":"檢查;稽查","s":"Health officials carry out a surprise ________ of night markets every summer, and stalls with dirty kitchens are fined.","zh":"衛生官員每年夏天都會對夜市進行突擊稽查,廚房骯髒的攤位會被罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"稽查"},{"w":"investment","pos":"n.","def":"money spent to get future benefits","cn":"投資","s":"More ________ in nurses would improve patient care, but the hospital says its budget is too small.","zh":"對護理人員更多的投資能改善病人照護,但醫院說它的預算太少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"投資"},{"w":"spending","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of money spent","cn":"支出","s":"Government ________ on health has grown every year, because the population is getting older very quickly.","zh":"政府在醫療上的支出逐年增加,因為人口正快速老化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"支出"},{"w":"progression","pos":"n.","def":"the process of developing or getting worse","cn":"進展;惡化","s":"The new drug slows the ________ of the disease, so patients can live normally for longer.","zh":"這種新藥能減緩疾病的進展,所以病人能更長時間正常生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"進展"},{"w":"marker","pos":"n.","def":"a sign that shows something exists","cn":"指標;標記","s":"High blood sugar is a ________ of diabetes risk, so doctors test it during every health check.","zh":"高血糖是糖尿病風險的指標,所以醫生在每次健康檢查時都會檢測。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"指標"},{"w":"association","pos":"n.","def":"a connection between two things","cn":"關聯","s":"Studies show a strong ________ between loneliness and poor health, so communities organise activities for seniors.","zh":"研究顯示孤獨與健康不佳之間有密切關聯,所以社區為長者舉辦活動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"關聯"},{"w":"contain","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from spreading","cn":"控制;遏制","s":"Health workers moved quickly to ________ the outbreak, so it stayed in one small town.","zh":"衛生人員迅速行動以遏制疫情,所以它只停留在一個小鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"遏制"},{"w":"insure","pos":"v.","def":"to buy insurance against loss or illness","cn":"為……投保","s":"Many parents ________ their children against accidents, because hospital costs can be very high in an emergency.","zh":"許多父母為孩子投保意外險,因為緊急情況下的住院費用可能非常高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"投保"},{"w":"ration","pos":"v.","def":"to limit how much of something each person can have","cn":"配給;限量供應","s":"At the start of the pandemic, the government had to ________ face masks, so each person could buy only a few a week.","zh":"疫情初期政府必須限量供應口罩,所以每人每週只能買幾個。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"限量供應"},{"w":"overuse","pos":"v.","def":"to use something too much","cn":"過度使用","s":"If people ________ antibiotics, germs become stronger, so doctors give them only when they are needed.","zh":"如果人們過度使用抗生素,病菌就會變得更強,所以醫生只在必要時才開藥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"過度使用"},{"w":"cope","pos":"v.","def":"to deal successfully with a difficult situation","cn":"應付;處理","s":"Small hospitals could not ________ with so many patients, so some people were sent to other cities.","zh":"小醫院無法應付這麼多病人,所以有些人被送到其他城市。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"應付"},{"w":"at-risk","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to be harmed","cn":"高風險的;易受危害的","s":"Free flu jabs are offered to ________ groups, such as pregnant women and people over sixty-five.","zh":"免費流感疫苗提供給高風險族群,例如孕婦和六十五歲以上的人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"高風險"},{"w":"high-risk","pos":"adj.","def":"having a greater chance of danger","cn":"高風險的","s":"Smokers are a ________ group for lung disease, so they are offered free lung scans every two years.","zh":"吸菸者是肺部疾病的高風險族群,所以每兩年提供他們免費肺部掃描。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"高風險"},{"w":"low-income","pos":"adj.","def":"earning little money","cn":"低收入的","s":"________ families can get free dental care for their children, but many parents do not know about it.","zh":"低收入家庭的孩子可以獲得免費牙科照護,但許多家長不知道這件事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"低收入"},{"w":"communicable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be passed from one person to another","cn":"傳染性的","s":"________ diseases like flu spread fast in schools, so sick students should stay at home.","zh":"像流感這樣的傳染性疾病在學校傳播得很快,所以生病的學生應該待在家裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"傳染性"},{"w":"degenerative","pos":"adj.","def":"getting gradually worse over time","cn":"退化性的","s":"Arthritis is a ________ disease, but exercise and a healthy weight can slow it down.","zh":"關節炎是一種退化性疾病,但運動和健康的體重可以減緩它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"退化性"},{"w":"deadly","pos":"adj.","def":"able to cause death","cn":"致命的","s":"The ________ virus killed thousands of people, so scientists worked day and night to develop a vaccine.","zh":"這種致命的病毒奪走了數千人的生命,所以科學家日以繼夜地研發疫苗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"致命的"},{"w":"unsafe","pos":"adj.","def":"dangerous","cn":"不安全的","s":"The water in the old well was ________ to drink, so the village built a new water system.","zh":"老井裡的水喝起來不安全,所以村子建了新的供水系統。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"不安全"},{"w":"generally","pos":"adv.","def":"usually; in most cases","cn":"一般而言;通常","s":"Women ________ live longer than men, but the gap in Taiwan has become smaller in recent years.","zh":"女性通常比男性長壽,但近年來台灣的差距已經縮小。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"通常"},{"w":"occasionally","pos":"adv.","def":"sometimes but not often","cn":"偶爾","s":"It is fine to eat fried chicken ________, but you should not eat it every day.","zh":"偶爾吃炸雞沒關係,但你不應該每天吃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"偶爾"},{"w":"overly","pos":"adv.","def":"too; very much","cn":"過度地","s":"Some parents are ________ worried about small colds, so they take their children to the doctor too often.","zh":"有些父母對小感冒過度擔心,所以太常帶孩子去看醫生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"過度"},{"w":"worryingly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that makes people worried","cn":"令人擔憂地","s":"________, more teenagers are using e-cigarettes, so many schools have started new health lessons about their dangers.","zh":"令人擔憂的是,越來越多青少年使用電子菸,所以許多學校開始了關於其危害的新健康課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"令人擔憂的是"},{"w":"dangerously","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that may cause harm","cn":"危險地","s":"His blood pressure was ________ high, so the doctor sent him straight to the hospital by ambulance.","zh":"他的血壓高得危險,所以醫生用救護車直接把他送到醫院。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"危險"},{"w":"heavily","pos":"adv.","def":"to a great degree","cn":"大量地;嚴重地","s":"People who drink ________ have a higher risk of liver disease, so doctors advise them to cut down.","zh":"大量飲酒的人罹患肝病的風險較高,所以醫生建議他們減量。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"大量"},{"w":"means-tested","pos":"adj.","def":"given only to people whose income is low enough","cn":"經資產調查的","s":"The care allowance is ________, so only families below a certain income can receive it.","zh":"照顧津貼是經資產調查的,所以只有收入低於一定標準的家庭才能領取。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"經資產調查的"},{"w":"taxation","pos":"n.","def":"the system of taxes","cn":"課稅;稅收","s":"Higher ________ on cigarettes helps pay for health care, and it also stops many young people from smoking.","zh":"對香菸提高課稅有助於支付醫療費用,也能阻止許多年輕人吸菸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"課稅"},{"w":"overcrowding","pos":"n.","def":"too many people in one place","cn":"過度擁擠","s":"________ in the emergency room is common in winter, so the hospital opened a new waiting area.","zh":"冬天急診室過度擁擠的情況很常見,所以醫院開設了新的候診區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"過度擁擠"},{"w":"licensing","pos":"n.","def":"giving official permission to do something","cn":"核發執照;許可","s":"Strict ________ of pharmacies protects the public, because only trained staff can sell strong medicine.","zh":"對藥局嚴格核發執照能保護大眾,因為只有受過訓練的人員才能販售強效藥物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"核發執照"},{"w":"certification","pos":"n.","def":"an official document that proves something","cn":"認證;證照","s":"Care workers need ________ before they can work in a nursing home, so they take a ninety-hour course.","zh":"照顧服務員在護理之家工作前需要取得證照,所以他們要上九十小時的課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"證照"},{"w":"quality","pos":"n.","def":"how good something is","cn":"品質","s":"The ________ of care in public hospitals is high, but the waiting times can be very long.","zh":"公立醫院的照護品質很高,但等候時間可能非常長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"品質"},{"w":"concern","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of worry","cn":"擔憂;關切","s":"There is growing ________ about teenage mental health, so the government has hired more school counsellors.","zh":"人們對青少年心理健康的擔憂日益增加,所以政府聘請了更多學校輔導人員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"擔憂"},{"w":"behaviour","pos":"n.","def":"the way a person acts","cn":"行為","s":"Changing unhealthy ________ takes time, so doctors encourage small steps like taking the stairs instead of the lift.","zh":"改變不健康的行為需要時間,所以醫生鼓勵從小地方做起,例如走樓梯而不搭電梯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"行為"},{"w":"belief","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that something is true","cn":"信念;看法","s":"There is a common ________ that cold drinks cause colds, but doctors say germs are the real cause.","zh":"人們普遍認為冷飲會導致感冒,但醫生說真正的原因是病菌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"認為"},{"w":"sharp","pos":"adj.","def":"sudden and large","cn":"急劇的","s":"There was a ________ rise in heatstroke cases during the heatwave, so the city opened cooling centres.","zh":"熱浪期間中暑病例急劇增加,所以市政府開放了避暑中心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"急劇"},{"w":"unequal","pos":"adj.","def":"not fair or the same for everyone","cn":"不平等的","s":"Access to doctors is ________ across the island, because most specialists work in big cities.","zh":"全島的就醫機會是不平等的,因為大多數專科醫師都在大城市工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"不平等的"},{"w":"under the weather","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"feeling a little ill","cn":"身體不適","s":"I felt a bit ______ ______ ______ this morning, so I stayed at home and drank lots of warm water.","zh":"我今天早上覺得有點身體不適,所以我待在家裡喝了很多溫水。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"身體不適"},{"w":"as fit as a fiddle","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"very healthy and strong","cn":"非常健康;身體硬朗","s":"My grandfather is eighty-five, but he is still ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ because he swims every morning.","zh":"我爺爺八十五歲了,但他仍然身體硬朗,因為他每天早上都去游泳。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"身體硬朗"},{"w":"an apple a day keeps the doctor away","pos":"phr.","def":"eating healthy food keeps you from getting ill","cn":"一天一蘋果,醫生遠離我","s":"My mother always puts fruit in my lunch box, because she believes that ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"我媽媽總是在我的便當盒裡放水果,因為她相信一天一蘋果,醫生遠離我。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"一天一蘋果,醫生遠離我"},{"w":"prevention is better than cure","pos":"phr.","def":"it is better to stop a problem than to fix it later","cn":"預防勝於治療","s":"The school nurse reminds us that ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so she teaches us to wash our hands properly.","zh":"學校護理師提醒我們預防勝於治療,所以她教我們正確地洗手。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"預防勝於治療"},{"w":"on the mend","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"getting better after an illness or injury","cn":"逐漸康復","s":"Grandma had a bad fall last month, but she is ______ ______ ______ now and can walk around the house again.","zh":"奶奶上個月重重摔了一跤,但她現在正逐漸康復,又能在家裡走動了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"逐漸康復"},{"w":"a clean bill of health","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a report saying that someone is healthy","cn":"健康證明;一切健康的診斷","s":"After a full check-up, the doctor gave my father ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so we celebrated with a family dinner.","zh":"做完全面健康檢查後,醫生說我爸爸一切健康,所以我們全家吃了一頓晚餐慶祝。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"一切健康"},{"w":"back on one's feet","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"healthy or active again after an illness","cn":"恢復健康;重新站起來","s":"It took my aunt three months after the operation, but she is finally ______ ______ ______ ______ and has returned to work.","zh":"我阿姨手術後花了三個月,但她終於恢復健康,已經回去上班了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"恢復健康"},{"w":"take a turn for the worse","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to suddenly become more ill","cn":"病情惡化","s":"My grandfather's condition ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ last night, so the whole family rushed to the hospital.","zh":"我爺爺的病情昨晚突然惡化,所以全家人急忙趕到醫院。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"突然惡化"},{"w":"over the hill","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"too old to do something well (informal)","cn":"過了巔峰;年紀大了","s":"My dad joked that he was ______ ______ ______ at fifty, but then he ran his first marathon the next year.","zh":"我爸爸開玩笑說他五十歲就已經過了巔峰,但隔年他就跑完了人生第一場馬拉松。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"過了巔峰"},{"w":"get on in years","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become old","cn":"上了年紀","s":"My grandparents are ______ ______ ______ ______, so we moved them to a flat with a lift last summer.","zh":"我的祖父母上了年紀,所以我們去年夏天幫他們搬到一間有電梯的公寓。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"上了年紀"},{"w":"age is just a number","pos":"phr.","def":"you can be active and happy at any age","cn":"年齡只是個數字","s":"My seventy-year-old neighbour started learning the guitar, and she says that ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"我七十歲的鄰居開始學吉他,她說年齡只是個數字。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"年齡只是個數字"},{"w":"come down with","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start to have an illness","cn":"染上(疾病)","s":"Half of my class ______ ______ ______ the flu last week, so the teacher postponed the test.","zh":"我們班上週有一半的人染上了流感,所以老師把考試延期了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"染上了"},{"w":"the picture of health","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who looks very healthy","cn":"健康的典範;看起來非常健康","s":"After a month in the countryside, my uncle looked like ______ ______ ______ ______, and his skin was brown from the sun.","zh":"在鄉下待了一個月後,我叔叔看起來非常健康,皮膚也被太陽曬成了古銅色。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"非常健康"},{"w":"a bitter pill to swallow","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an unpleasant fact that you must accept","cn":"難以接受的事實","s":"Being told to stop playing football because of his knee was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but he became a coach instead.","zh":"因為膝蓋問題被告知不能再踢足球,對他來說是難以接受的事實,但他後來改當教練。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"難以接受的事實"},{"w":"laughter is the best medicine","pos":"phr.","def":"laughing helps you feel better","cn":"笑是最好的良藥","s":"The volunteers tell jokes to the children in hospital, because they believe ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"志工們對住院的孩子們講笑話,因為他們相信笑是最好的良藥。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"笑是最好的良藥"},{"w":"a new lease of life","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a chance to be active and happy again","cn":"重獲新生;煥然一新","s":"The hip operation gave my grandmother ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, and now she goes dancing twice a week.","zh":"髖關節手術讓我奶奶重獲新生,現在她每週去跳舞兩次。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"重獲新生"},{"w":"flatten the curve","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to slow the spread of a disease so hospitals can cope","cn":"使疫情曲線趨緩","s":"Everyone stayed at home to help ______ ______ ______, so the hospitals had enough beds for the sickest patients.","zh":"每個人都待在家裡協助讓疫情曲線趨緩,所以醫院有足夠的病床給最嚴重的病人。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"讓疫情曲線趨緩"},{"w":"kick the habit","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stop doing something harmful, such as smoking","cn":"戒掉惡習","s":"My uncle smoked for thirty years, but he finally ______ ______ ______ when his first grandchild was born.","zh":"我叔叔抽了三十年菸,但在第一個孫子出生時終於戒掉了這個惡習。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"戒掉了這個惡習"},{"w":"pull through","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to recover from a serious illness","cn":"度過難關;康復","s":"The doctors were not sure he would survive the accident, but he ______ ______ and left hospital in May.","zh":"醫生們不確定他能否撐過那場車禍,但他度過了難關,並在五月出院。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"度過了難關"},{"w":"young at heart","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"feeling and acting young although you are old","cn":"心態年輕","s":"My grandmother is eighty but very ______ ______ ______, so she loves trying new games with her grandchildren.","zh":"我奶奶八十歲了但心態非常年輕,所以她喜歡和孫子們一起嘗試新遊戲。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"心態 年輕"}]};
